 your QUIC.cloud account.'=>'Tovuti haitambuliki. QUIC.cloud imezimwa kiotomatiki. Tafadhali wezesha tena akaunti yako ya QUIC.cloud.','Click here to proceed.'=>'Bonyeza hapa uendelee.','QUIC.cloud\'s access to your WP REST API seems to be blocked.'=>'Upatikanaji wa QUIC.cloud kwenye WP REST API yako unaonekana umezuiwa.','Failed to get echo data from WPAPI'=>'Imeshindikana kupata data za echo kutoka WPAPI','You need to set the %1$s first. Please use the command %2$s to set.'=>'Unahitaji kuweka %1$s kwanza. Tafadhali tumia amri ya %2$s kuweka.','Server IP'=>'IP ya Seva','You need to activate QC first.'=>'Inabidi uanzishe QC kwanza.','Cert or key file does not exist.'=>'Cheti au faili ya ufunguo haipo.','Reset %s activation successfully.'=>'Kuanzisha upya uwezeshaji wa %s kumefaulu.','Linked to QUIC.cloud preview environment, for testing purpose only.'=>'Imeunganishwa kwenye mazingira ya hakikisho ya QUIC.cloud, kwa madhumuni ya majaribio pekee.','Cloud Error'=>'Hitilafu ya Wingu','No available Cloud Node after checked server load.'=>'Hakuna Cloud Node inayopatikana baada ya kukagua mzigo wa seva.','No available Cloud Node.'=>'Hakuna Cloud Node inayopatikana.','In order to use QC services, need a real domain name, cannot use an IP.'=>'Ili kutumia huduma za QC, unahitaji jina halisi la kikoa, huwezi kutumia anwani ya IP.','Please try after %1$s for service %2$s.'=>'Tafadhali jaribu baada ya %1$s kwa huduma %2$s.','Failed to request via WordPress'=>'Imeshindwa kuomba kupitia WordPress','Cloud server refused the current request due to unpulled images. Please pull the images first.'=>'Seva ya wingu imekataa ombi la sasa kwa sababu ya picha ambazo hazijavutwa. Tafadhali vuta picha kwanza.','Your domain_key has been temporarily blocklisted to prevent abuse. You may contact support at QUIC.cloud to learn more.'=>'Kikoa chako cha domain_key kimezuiliwa kwa muda ili kuzuia matumizi mabaya. Unaweza kuwasiliana na usaidizi katika QUIC.cloud ili kujifunza zaidi.','Cloud server refused the current request due to rate limiting. Please try again later.'=>'Seva ya wingu imekataa ombi la sasa kwa sababu ya kikomo cha kasi. Tafadhali jaribu tena baadaye.','Redetected node'=>'Kituo kilichotambuliwa upya','We are working hard to improve your online service experience. The service will be unavailable while we work. We apologize for any inconvenience.'=>'Tunafanya kazi kwa bidii ili kuboresha uzoefu wako wa huduma ya mtandaoni. Huduma haitapatikana wakati tunafanya kazi. Tunaomba radhi kwa usumbufu wowote.','Message from QUIC.cloud server'=>'Ujumbe kutoka kwa seva ya QUIC.cloud','Good news from QUIC.cloud server'=>'Habari njema kutoka kwa seva ya QUIC.cloud','%1$s plugin version %2$s required for this action.'=>'Toleo la programu-jalizi %1$s %2$s linahitajika kwa hatua hii.','Failed to communicate with QUIC.cloud server'=>'Imeshindikana kuwasiliana na seva ya QUIC.cloud','Sync QUIC.cloud status successfully.'=>'Hali ya QUIC.cloud imelandanishwa kwa mafanikio.','Sync credit allowance with Cloud Server successfully.'=>'Usawazishaji wa mgao wa mikopo na Cloud Server umefaulu.','Saving option failed. IPv4 only for %s.'=>'Imeshindwa kuhifadhi chaguo. IPv4 pekee kwa %s.','Changed setting successfully.'=>'Mpangilio umebadilishwa kikamilifu.','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge everything.'=>'Imearifu LiteSpeed Web Server kufuta kila kitu.','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge the list.'=>'Imearifu LiteSpeed Web Server kufuta orodha hiyo.','Sitemap cleaned successfully'=>'Ramani ya tovuti imesafishwa kwa mafanikio','No valid sitemap parsed for crawler.'=>'Hakuna ramani halali ya tovuti iliyochanganuliwa kwa ajili ya kitambaa.','Sitemap created successfully: %d items'=>'Ramani ya tovuti imetengenezwa kwa mafanikio: vipengee %d','Crawler disabled list is cleared! All crawlers are set to active! '=>'Orodha ya watambaji waliocheleweshwa imeondolewa! Watambaji wote wamewekwa kuwa hai!','Started async crawling'=>'Utambaji wa asynchronous umeanza','Guest'=>