web page that is on display on this site. All cache files are temporary, and are never accessed by any third party, except as necessary to obtain technical support from the cache plugin vendor. Cache files expire on a schedule set by the site administrator, but may easily be purged by the admin before their natural expiration, if necessary. We may use QUIC.cloud services to process & cache your data temporarily.'=>'Tovuti hii hutumia mbinu ya kuhifadhi kumbukumbu za muda (caching) ili kuwezesha muda wa jibu la haraka zaidi na uzoefu bora kwa mtumiaji. Uhifadhi huo una uwezo wa kutunza nakala ya pili ya kila ukurasa wa wavuti unaoonyeshwa kwenye tovuti hii. Faili zote za kumbukumbu za muda ni za mpito, na hazifikiwi kamili na upande wowote wa tatu, isipokuwa inapohitajika ili kupata usaidizi wa kiufundi kutoka kwa mtoa huduma wa programu jalizi ya kumbukumbu hiyo. Faili za kumbukumbu za muda huisha muda wake kulingana na ratiba iliyowekwa na msimamizi wa tovuti, lakini zinaweza kufutwa kwa urahisi na msimamizi kabla ya muda wake wa asili kuisha, ikiwa ni lazima. Tunaweza kutumia huduma za QUIC.cloud kuchakata na kuhifadhi data yako kwa muda.','Please see %s for more details.'=>'Tafadhali rejelea %s kwa maelezo zaidi.','Learn More'=>'Jifunze Zaidi','Both full and partial strings can be used.'=>'Minyororo kamili na ya sehemu zote inaweza kutumika.','Both full URLs and partial strings can be used.'=>'URL kamili na vigezo vifupi vinaweza kutumika.','This setting will edit the .htaccess file.'=>'Mpangilio huu utabadilisha faili ya .htaccess.','The queue is processed asynchronously. It may take time.'=>'Foleni inasindikwa kwa njia ya asynkronous. Inaweza kuchukua muda.','This feature needs an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin. The setting has no effect.'=>'Kipengele hiki kinahitaji huduma ya uzalishaji mtandaoni, ambayo haijajumuishwa kwenye programu-jalizi hii. Mpangilio hauna athari.','You have used all of your daily quota for today.'=>'Umetumia kikomo chako chote cha kila siku kwa leo.','Learn more or purchase additional quota.'=>'Jifunze zaidi au nunua nafasi ya ziada.','You have used all of your quota left for current service this month.'=>'Ulitumia kiasi chote cha mgao wako kilichobaki kwa huduma ya sasa mwezi huu.','You have too many requested images, please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Una picha nyingi ulizoomba, tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','You have images waiting to be pulled. Please wait for the automatic pull to complete, or pull them down manually now.'=>'Una picha zinazosubiri kuvutwa. Tafadhali subiri uvutaji otomatiki ukamilike, au uzivute wewe mwenyewe sasa.','The image list is empty.'=>'Orodha ya picha ni tupu.','Not enough parameters. Please check if the QUIC.cloud connection is set correctly'=>'Vigezo haitoshi. Tafadhali angalia ikiwa muunganisho wa QUIC.cloud umewekwa kwa usahihi','There is proceeding queue not pulled yet.'=>'Kuna foleni ya kuendelea ambayo bado haijavuta.','There is proceeding queue not pulled yet. Queue info: %s.'=>'Kuna foleni inayoendelea ambayo haijavutwa bado. Taarifa za foleni: %s.','The site is not a valid alias on QUIC.cloud.'=>'Tovuti hii si lakabu halali kwenye QUIC.cloud.','The site is not registered on QUIC.cloud.'=>'Tovuti haijasajiliwa kwenye QUIC.cloud.','The QUIC.cloud connection is not correct. Please try to sync your QUIC.cloud connection again.'=>'Muunganisho wa QUIC.cloud si sahihi. Tafadhali jaribu kusawazisha muunganisho wako wa QUIC.cloud tena.','The current server is under heavy load.'=>'Seva ya sasa inatumia rasilimali nyingi sana.','Online node needs to be redetected.'=>'Node ya mtandaoni inahitaji kugunduliwa upya.','Credits are not enough to proceed the current request.'=>'Salio hayatoshi haitoshi kabla ya kuendelea na ombi hili.','%s file not writable.'=>'Faili la %s haliwezi kuandikika.','Could not find %1$s in %2$s.'=>'Imeshindikana kupata %1$s katika %2$s.','Invalid login cookie. Please check the %s file.'=>'Kuki 