.','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge all pages.'=>'Imearifu Seva ya Wavu ya LiteSpeed kufuta kurasa zote.','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge error pages.'=>'Imearifu LiteSpeed Web Server kufuta kurasa za makosa.','Purge category %s'=>'Futa kategoria %s','Purge tag %s'=>'Futa lebo %s','Purge url %s'=>'Safisha URL %s','All QUIC.cloud service queues have been cleared.'=>'Foleni zote za huduma za QUIC.cloud zimefutwa.','Every 15 Minutes'=>'Kila Dakika 15','LiteSpeed Crawler Cron'=>'Cron ya LiteSpeed Crawler','Failed to detect IP'=>'Imeshindikana kugundua IP','right now'=>'kwa sasa','just now'=>'sasa hivi',' %s ago'=>'%s iliyopita','Please consider disabling the following detected plugins, as they may conflict with Zinn® Cache Engine:'=>'Tafadhali zingatia kulemaza programu-jalizi zifuatazo zilizogunduliwa, kwani zinaweza kuingilia kati na Zinn® Cache Engine:','WooCommerce Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya WooCommerce','NOTICE:'=>'TANGAZO:','After verifying that the cache works in general, please test the cart.'=>'Baada ya kuthibitisha kuwa kache inafanya kazi kwa ujumla, tafadhali jaribu rukwama.','To test the cart, visit the %sFAQ%s.'=>'Ili kujaribu rukwama, tembelea %sMaswali Yanayoulizwa Mara kwa Mara%s.','By default, the My Account, Checkout, and Cart pages are automatically excluded from caching. Misconfiguration of page associations in WooCommerce settings may cause some pages to be erroneously excluded.'=>'Kwa chaguo-msingi, kurasa za Akaunti Yangu, Malipo, na Kikapu hutengwa kiotomatiki kutoka kwa uhifadhi kwenye akiba. Usanidi mbaya wa uhusiano wa kurasa katika mipangilio ya WooCommerce unaweza kusababisha baadhi ya kurasa kutengwa kimakosa.','Product Update Interval'=>'Muda wa Kusasisha Bidhaa','Purge product on changes to the quantity or stock status.'=>'Safisha bidhaa wakati kuna mabadiliko ya idadi au hali ya bidhaa kwenye ghala.','Purge categories only when stock status changes.'=>'Safisha makundi tu wakati hali ya bidhaa inapobadilika.','Purge product and categories only when the stock status changes.'=>'Safisha bidhaa na kategoria tu wakati hali ya hisa inapobadilika.','Purge product only when the stock status changes.'=>'Safisha bidhaa tu wakati hali ya hisa inapobadilika.','Do not purge categories on changes to the quantity or stock status.'=>'Usiondoe kategoria wakati wingi au hali ya bidhaa kwenye ghalani inapobadilika.','Always purge both product and categories on changes to the quantity or stock status.'=>'Daima futa bidhaa na kategoria zote mabadiliko yanapofanywa kwa idadi au hali ya akiba.','Determines how changes in product quantity and product stock status affect product pages and their associated category pages.'=>'Inaamua jinsi mabadiliko katika wingi wa bidhaa na hali ya hisa ya bidhaa yanavyoathiri kurasa za bidhaa na kurasa zao za kategoria zinazohusiana.','Vary for Mini Cart'=>'Badilisha kwa Ajili ya Rukwama Ndogo','Generate a separate vary cache copy for the mini cart when the cart is not empty.'=>'Tengeneza nakala tofauti ya akiba ya utofauti kwa ajili ya mkokoteni mdogo wakati mkokoteni hauna tupu.','If your theme does not use JS to update the mini cart, you must enable this option to display the correct cart contents.'=>'Ikiwa mandhari yako haitumii JS kusasisha rukwama ndogo, lazima uwashe chaguo hili ili kuonyesha yaliyomo sahihi ya rukwama.','New Developer Version Available!'=>'Toleo Jipya la Wasanidi Programu Linapatikana!','New developer version %s is available now.'=>'Toleo jipya la watengenezaji programu %s linapatikana sasa.','Upgrade'=>'Boresha','Purge'=>'Futa kabisa','Excludes'=>'Haijumuishi','Object'=>'Kitu','Browser'=>'Kivinjari','Advanced'=>'Ya Juu','Zinn® Cache Engine Network Cache Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya Akiba ya Mtandao ya Zinn® Cache Engine','TTL'=>'TTL','ESI'=>'ESI','Zinn® Cache Engine Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya Injini ya Akiba ya Zinn®','NOTE'=>'ANDIKA KONTENUTI','More settings available under %s menu'=>'Mipangilio zaidi inapatikana chini ya menyu ya %s','Advanced Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya Kina','Cache Control Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya Kudhibiti Akiba','Network Enable Cache'=>'Wezesha Akiba ya Mtandao','Enabling Zinn® Cache Engine for WordPress here enables the cache for the network.'=>'Kuwezesha Zinn® Cache Engine ya WordPress hapa kunawezesha akiba kwa mtandao mzima.','It is STRONGLY recommended that the compatibility with other plugins on a single/few sites is tested first.'=>'InapendekAZWA SANA kwamba utangamano na programu-jalizi zingine kwenye tovuti moja/chache ujaribiwe kwanza.','This is to ensure compatibility prior to enabling the cache for all sites.'=>'Hii ni ili kuhakikisha upatanifu kabla ya kuwezesha kache kwa tovuti zote.','Exclude Settings'=>'Ondoa Mipangilio','Purge Settings'=>'Futa Mipangilio','These settings are meant for ADVANCED USERS ONLY.'=>'Mipangilio hii ni kwa ajili ya WATUMIAJI WAKONGWE TU.','Specify an AJAX action in POST/GET and the number of seconds to cache that request, separated by a space.'=>'Taja kitendo cha AJAX katika POST/GET na idadi ya sekunde za kuweka akiba ombi hilo, zikitenganishwa na nafasi.','Enable this option if you are using both HTTP and HTTPS in the same domain and are noticing cache irregularities.'=>'Washa chaguo hili ikiwa unatumia HTTP na HTTPS kwenye kikoa kimoja na unatambua kutokuwa thabiti kwa akiba.','When a visitor hovers over a page link, preload that page. This will speed up the visit to that link.'=>'Mgeni anapoelea juu ya kiungo cha ukurasa, pakia ukurasa huo mapema. Hii itaharakisha ziara ya kiungo hicho.','This will generate extra requests to the server, which will increase server load.'=>'Hii itazalisha maombi ya ziada kwa seva, jambo ambalo litaongeza mzigo wa seva.','Use Network Admin Setting'=>'Tumia Mpangilio wa Msimamizi wa Mtandao','Please visit the %sInformation%s page on how to test the cache.'=>'Tafadhali tembelea ukurasa wa %sTaarifa%s kuhusu jinsi ya kupima akiba.','NOTICE'=>'ILANI','When disabling the cache, all cached entries for this site will be purged.'=>'Unapozima akiba, maingizo yote yaliyohifadhiwa kwenye akiba kwa tovuti hii yatafutwa kabisa.','The network admin setting can be overridden here.'=>'Mpangilio wa msimamizi wa mtandao unaweza kubatilishwa hapa.','Privately cache frontend pages for logged-in users. (LSWS %s required)'=>'Weka kache ya faragha kwa kurasa za mbele kwa watumiaji waliounganishwa. (LSWS %s inahitajika)','Privately cache commenters that have pending comments. Disabling this option will serve non-cacheable pages to commenters. (LSWS %s required)'=>'Hifadhi kwa siri maoni ya watoa maoni ambao wana maoni yanayosubiri. Kuzima chaguo hili kutatoa kurasa zisizoweza kuhifadhiwa kwenye akiba kwa watoa maoni. (LSWS %s inahitajika)','Cache requests made by WordPress REST API calls.'=>'Hifadhi akiba (cache) maombi yaliyofanywa na miito ya WordPress REST API.','Disabling this option may negatively affect performance.'=>'Kuzima chaguo hili kunaweza kuathiri vibaya utendakazi.','URI Paths containing these strings will NOT be cached as public.'=>'Njia za URI zilizo na vigezo hivi hazitahifadhiwa kwenye kache kama za umma.','Paths containing these strings will be cached regardless of no-cacheable settings.'=>'Njia zilizo na mifuatano hii zitahifadhiwa kwenye akiba bila kujali mipangilio ya kutoweza kuhifadhiwa.','To define a custom TTL for a URI, add a space followed by the TTL value to the end of the URI.'=>'Ili kufafanua TTL maalum kwa ajili ya URI, ongeza nafasi ikifuatiwa na thamani ya TTL mwishoni mwa URI.','For example, %1$s defines a TTL of %2$s seconds for %3$s.'=>'Kwa mfano, %1$s inafafanua TTL ya sekunde %2$s kwa %3$s.','Paths containing these strings will be forced to public cached regardless of no-cacheable settings.'=>'Njia zilizo na mifuatano hii zitalazimishwa kuwa za akiba ya umma bila kujali mipangilio isiyoweza kuhifadhiwa kwenye akiba.','ESI Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya ESI','With ESI (Edge Side Includes), pages may be served from cache for logged-in users.'=>'Kwa kutumia ESI (Edge Side Includes), kurasa zinaweza kutolewa kutoka kwenye akiba (cache) kwa watumiaji walioingia kwenye akaunti zao.','ESI allows you to designate parts of your dynamic page as separate fragments that are then assembled together to make the whole page. In other words, ESI lets you “punch holes” in a page, and then fill those holes with content that may be cached privately, cached publicly with its own TTL, or not cached at all.'=>'ESI inakuwezesha kuteua sehemu za ukurasa wako amilifu kama vipande tofauti ambavyo baadaye huunganishwa pamoja ili kutengeneza ukurasa mzima. Kwa maneno mengine, ESI inakuwezesha "kutoboa matundu" kwenye ukurasa, na kisha kujaza matundu hayo kwa maudhui ambayo yanaweza kuhifadhiwa kwenye akiba kibinafsi, kuhifadhiwa hadharani na TTL yake yenyewe, au kutohifadhiwa kabisa kwenye akiba.','WpW: Private Cache vs. Public Cache'=>'WpW: Akiba ya Kibinafsi dhidi ya Akiba ya Umma','You can turn shortcodes into ESI blocks.'=>'Unaweza kubadili misimbo fupi kuwa vizuizi vya ESI.','Replace %1$s with %2$s.'=>'Badilisha %1$s na %2$s.','ESI sample for developers'=>'Mfano wa ESI kwa watengenezaji programu','WARNING'=>'ONYO','These options are only available with LiteSpeed Enterprise Web Server.'=>'Chaguo hizi zinapatikana tu na LiteSpeed Enterprise Web Server.','Turn ON to cache public pages for logged in users, and serve the Admin Bar and Comment Form via ESI blocks. These two blocks will be uncached unless enabled below.'=>'Washa ili kuhifadhi kurasa za umma kwenye akiba kwa ajili ya watumiaji walioingia kwenye mfumo, na utoe Upau wa Msimamizi na Fomu ya Maoni kupitia vitalu vya ESI. Vitalu hivi viwili havitahifadhiwa kwenye akiba isipokuwa viwezeshwe hapa chini.','Cache the built-in Admin Bar ESI block.'=>'Hifadhi kwenye kache bloku ya ESI ya Upau wa Msimamizi iliyojengewa ndani.','Cache the built-in Comment Form ESI block.'=>'Hifadhi kache kizuizi cha ESI cha Fomu ya Maoni iliyojengwa ndani.','The list will be merged with the predefined nonces in your local data file.'=>'Orodha hiyo itaunganishwa na nonces zilizowekwa mapema kwenye faili yako ya data ya ndani.','The latest data file is'=>'Faili la hivi punde la data ni','Filter %s is supported.'=>'Kichujio cha %s kinaungwa mkono.','The above nonces will be converted to ESI automatically.'=>'Noni zilizo hapo juu zitabadilishwa kuwa ESI moja kwa moja.','An optional second parameter may be used to specify cache control. Use a space to separate'=>'Kigezo cha pili cha hiari kinaweza kutumika kubainisha udhibiti wa akiba. Tumia nafasi wazi kutenganisha','Wildcard %1$s supported (match zero or more characters). For example, to match %2$s and %3$s, use %4$s.'=>'Kiboreshaji cha kadi pori %1$s kinaauniwa (kinalingana na herufi sifuri au zaidi). Kwa mfano, ili kulinganisha na %2$s na %3$s, tumia %4$s.','If your site contains public content that certain user roles can see but other roles cannot, you can specify a Vary Group for those user roles. For example, specifying an administrator vary group allows there to be a separate publicly-cached page tailored to administrators (with “edit” links, etc), while all other user roles see the default public page.'=>'Ikiwa tovuti yako ina maudhui ya umma ambayo baadhi ya jukumu za mtumiaji zinaweza kuona lakini nyingine haziwezi, unaweza kubainisha Kundi la Vary kwa ajili ya jukumu hilo la mtumiaji. Kwa mfano, kubainisha kundi la vary la msimamizi kunaruhusu kuwepo kwa ukurasa maalum uliowekwa kwenye kache ya umma kwa ajili ya wasimamizi (wenye viungo vya "hariri", n.k.), wakati jukumu zingine zote za mtumiaji zinaona ukurasa chaguomsingi wa umma.','Paths containing these strings will not be cached.'=>'Njia zilizo na mistari hii hazitahifadhiwa kwenye kache.','Predefined list will also be combined w/ the above settings'=>'Orodha iliyotangulia kuandaliwa pia itachanganywa na mipangilio iliyo hapo juu','Query strings containing these parameters will not be cached.'=>'Mirija ya utafutaji iliyo na vigezo hivi haitahifadhiwa kwenye akiba ya muda.','For example, for %1$s, %2$s and %3$s can be used here.'=>'Kwa mfano, kwa %1$s, %2$s na %3$s zinaweza kutumika hapa.','All categories are cached by default.'=>'Kategoria zote zimehifadhiwa kwenye kache kwa chaguo-msingi.','To prevent %s from being cached, enter them here.'=>'Ili kuzuia %s isihifadhiwe kwenye akiba, ziweke hapa.','categories'=>'kategoria','If the category name is not found, the category will be removed from the list on save.'=>'Kama jina la kategoria halijapatikana, kategoria itaondolewa kwenye orodha wakati wa kuhifadhi.','All tags are cached by default.'=>'Lebo zote zinahifadhiwa kwenye kache kwa chaguomsingi.','tags'=>'Lebo','If the tag slug is not found, the tag will be removed from the list on save.'=>'Ikiwa kitambulisho cha lebo hakitapatikana, lebo itaondolewa kwenye orodha wakati wa kuhifadhi.','To exclude %1$s, insert %2$s.'=>'Ili kutenga %1$s, ingiza %2$s.','Selected roles will be excluded from cache.'=>'Majukumu yaliyochaguliwa yataondolewa kwenye kache.','All pages'=>'Kurasa zote','Front page'=>'Ukurasa wa mbele','Home page'=>'Ukurasa wa kwanza','Pages'=>'Kurasa','All pages with Recent Posts Widget'=>'Kurasa zote zilizo na Wijeti ya Machapisho ya Hivi Karibuni','Author archive'=>'Kumbukumbu la mwandishi','Post type archive'=>'Hifadhi ya aina ya chapisho','Yearly archive'=>'Hifadhi ya kila mwaka','Monthly archive'=>'Hifadhi ya kila mwezi','Daily archive'=>'Hifadhi ya kila siku','Term archive (include category, tag, and tax)'=>'Hifadhi ya kumbukumbu ya istilahi (jumuisha kategoria, lebo, na kodi)','Auto Purge Rules For Publish/Update'=>'Sheria za Kufuta Kiotomatiki za Kuchapisha/Kusasisha','Note'=>'Ujumbe','Select "All" if there are dynamic widgets linked to posts on pages other than the front or home pages.'=>'Chagua "Zote" ikiwa kuna wijeti dhabiti zilizounganishwa na machapisho kwenye kurasa nyingine isipokuwa kurasa za mbele au za nyumbani.','Other checkboxes will be ignored.'=>'Visanduku vingine vyote vya kuteua vitapuuzwa.','Select only the archive types that are currently used, the others can be left unchecked.'=>'Chagua tu aina za kumbukumbu zinazotumika kwa sasa, zingine zinaweza kuachwa bila kuteuliwa.','Select which pages will be automatically purged when posts are published/updated.'=>'Chagua kurasa zitakazosafishwa kiotomatiki machapisho yanapochapishwa/kusasishwa.','If ON, the stale copy of a cached page will be shown to visitors until a new cache copy is available. Reduces the server load for following visits. If OFF, the page will be dynamically generated while visitors wait.'=>'Ikiwa IMEWASHWA, nakala ya zamani ya ukurasa uliowekwa kwenye akiba itaonyeshwa kwa wageni hadi nakala mpya ya akiba itakapopatikana. Hupunguza mzigo wa seva kwa ziara zinazofuata. Ikiwa IMEZIMWA, ukurasa utatolewa kwa nguvu wakati wageni wanasubiri.','By design, this option may serve stale content. Do not enable this option, if that is not OK with you.'=>'Kulingana na muundo wake, chaguo hili linaweza kuleta maudhui yaliyopitwa na wakati. Usiwashe chaguo hili, ikiwa hilo halifai kwako.','The URLs here (one per line) will be purged automatically at the time set in the option "%s".'=>'URL zilizopo hapa (moja kwa kila mstari) zitasafishwa kiotomatiki wakati uliowekwa katika chaguo "%s".','Both %1$s and %2$s are acceptable.'=>'Zote %1$s na %2$s zinakubalika.','For URLs with wildcards, there may be a delay in initiating scheduled purge.'=>'Kwa URLs zilizo na wildcards, kunaweza kuwa na ucheleweshaji katika kuanzisha uondoaji uliopangwa.','Specify the time to purge the "%s" list.'=>'Taja muda wa kusafisha orodha ya "%s".','Current server time is %s.'=>'Wakati wa sasa wa seva ni %s.','A Purge All will be executed when WordPress runs these hooks.'=>'Usafishaji Kina (Purge All) utafanywa wakati WordPress itakapoweka vigwe hivi (hooks).','Specify how long, in seconds, public pages are cached.'=>'Taja muda, kwa sekunde, ambao kurasa za umma zinahifadhiwa kwenye kache.','Specify how long, in seconds, private pages are cached.'=>'Bainisha muda, katika sekunde, ambao kurasa za faragha huwekwa kwenye kache.','Specify how long, in seconds, the front page is cached.'=>'Bainisha muda, kwa sekunde, ambao ukurasa wa mbele umehifadhiwa kwenye kache.','Specify how long, in seconds, feeds are cached.'=>'Taja muda gani, kwa sekunde, ambapo milisho huhifadhiwa kwenye kashia.','If this is set to a number less than 30, feeds will not be cached.'=>'Ikiwa imewekwa kuwa nambari chini ya 30, milisho haitahifadhiwa kwenye kache.','Specify how long, in seconds, REST calls are cached.'=>'Taja muda, kwa sekunde, ambao simu za REST zinahifadhiwa kwenye kache.','Specify an HTTP status code and the number of seconds to cache that page, separated by a space.'=>'Taja nambari ya hali ya HTTP na idadi ya sekunde za kuhifadhi ukurasa huo kwenye akiba, zikitenganishwa na nafasi.','Browser Cache Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya Akiba ya Kivinjari','OpenLiteSpeed users please check this'=>'Watumiaji wa OpenLiteSpeed tafadhali angalieni hili','Setting Up Custom Headers'=>'Inasanidi Vichwa Maalum vya Habari','Browser caching stores static files locally in the user\'s browser. Turn on this setting to reduce repeated requests for static files.'=>'Kache ya kivinjari huhifadhi faili tuli ndani ya kivinjari cha mtumiaji. Washa mpangilio huu ili kupunguza maombi yanayorudiwa ya faili tuli.','You can turn on browser caching in server admin too. %sLearn more about LiteSpeed browser cache settings%s.'=>'Unaweza kuwezesha uhifadhi wa akiba wa kivinjari katika usimamizi wa seva pia. %sJifunze zaidi kuhusu mipangilio ya akiba ya kivinjari ya LiteSpeed%s.','The amount of time, in seconds, that files will be stored in browser cache before expiring.'=>'Muda, kwa sekunde, ambao faili zitahifadhiwa kwenye kache ya kivinjari kabla ya kuisha muda wake.','Ignore certain query strings when caching. (LSWS %s required)'=>'Puuza misimbo fulani ya hoja wakati wa kuhifadhi kwenye akiba. (LSWS %s inahitajika)','For example, to drop parameters beginning with %1$s, %2$s can be used here.'=>'Kwa mfano, ili kuondoa vigezo vinavyoanza na %1$s, %2$s inaweza kutumika hapa.','Serve a separate cache copy for mobile visitors.'=>'Toa nakala ya kache tofauti kwa wageni wa simu za mkononi.','Learn more about when this is needed'=>'Jifunze zaidi kuhusu wakati hii inahitajika','Htaccess did not match configuration option.'=>'Faili la Htaccess halikulingana na chaguo la usanidi.','Htaccess rule is: %s'=>'Sheria ya Htaccess ni: %s','If %1$s is %2$s, then %3$s must be populated!'=>'Ikiwa %1$s ni %2$s, basi %3$s lazima ijazwe!','cookies'=>'vidakocheza','user agents'=>'mawakala wa watumiaji','SYNTAX: alphanumeric and "_". No spaces and case sensitive. MUST BE UNIQUE FROM OTHER WEB APPLICATIONS.'=>'SINTAKSIA: herufi, namba na "_". Hakuna nafasi na herufi kubwa ni tofauti na ndogo. LAZIMA IWE YA KIPEPEO KUTOKA KWENYE PROGRAMU NYINGINE ZA WETU.','The default login cookie is %s.'=>'Kuki chaguo-msingi cha kuingia ni %s.','The server will determine if the user is logged in based on the existence of this cookie.'=>'Seva itabaini ikiwa mtumiaji ameingia kwenye akaunti kulingana na kuwepo kwa kuki hii.','This setting is useful for those that have multiple web applications for the same domain.'=>'Mpangilio huu ni muhimu kwa wale walio na programu za wavuti nyingi kwa kikoa kimoja.','If every web application uses the same cookie, the server may confuse whether a user is logged in or not.'=>'Kila programu ya mtwavulio ikitumia kuki ile ile, seva inaweza kuchanganya iwapo mtumiaji ameingia kwenye akaunti au la.','The cookie set here will be used for this WordPress installation.'=>'Kuki itakayowekwa hapa itatumika kwa usakinishaji huu wa WordPress.','Example use case:'=>'Mfano wa matumizi:','There is a WordPress installed for %s.'=>'Kuna WordPress imesakinishwa kwa ajili ya %s.','Then another WordPress is installed (NOT MULTISITE) at %s'=>'Kisha WordPress nyingine imewekwa (SI MULTISITE) katika %s','The cache needs to distinguish who is logged into which WordPress site in order to cache correctly.'=>'Akiba ya muda inahitaji kutofautisha ni nani aliyeingia kwenye tovuti ipi ya WordPress ili iweze kuweka akiba kwa usahihi.','Invalid login cookie. Invalid characters found.'=>'Kuki ya kuingia si sahihi. Herufi zisizoruhusiwa zimepatikana.','WARNING: The .htaccess login cookie and Database login cookie do not match.'=>'ONYO: Kuki ya kuingia ya .htaccess na kuki ya kuingia ya Hifadhidata hazilingani.','SYNTAX: alphanumeric and "_". No spaces and case sensitive.'=>'SYNTAX: herufi na namba na "_". Hakuna nafasi na ni nyeti kwa herufi kubwa na ndogo.','You can list the 3rd party vary cookies here.'=>'Unaweza kuorodheta vidakuzi vya wahusika wengine hapa.','Enabled'=>'Imewezeshwa','Disabled'=>'Imezimwa','Not Available'=>'Haipatikani','Passed'=>'Imefaulu','Failed'=>'Imeshindwa','Object Cache Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya Akiba ya Vitu','Use external object cache functionality.'=>'Tumia utendaji wa kache ya vitu vya nje.','Status'=>'Hali','%s Extension'=>'Ugani wa %s','Connection Test'=>'Jaribio la Muunganisho','Your %s Hostname or IP address.'=>'Hostname au Anwani ya IP yako ya %s.','If you are using a %1$s socket, %2$s should be set to %3$s'=>'Kama unatumia soketi ya %1$s, %2$s inapaswa kuwekwa kuwa %3$s','Default port for %1$s is %2$s.'=>'Bandari chaguo-msingi kwa %1$s ni %2$s.','Default TTL for cached objects.'=>'Muda wa Maisha chaguo-msingi kwa vitu vilivyohifadhiwa kwenye kache.','Only available when %s is installed.'=>'Inapatikana tu wakati %s imewekwa.','Specify the password used when connecting.'=>'Taja nenosiri linalotumiwa wakati wa kuunganisha.','Database to be used'=>'Hifadhi data itakayotumiwa','Groups cached at the network level.'=>'Vikundi vimehifadhiwa kwenye kiwango cha mtandao.','Use keep-alive connections to speed up cache operations.'=>'Tumia miunganisho ya keep-alive ili kuharakisha shughuli za kashi.','Improve wp-admin speed through caching. (May encounter expired data)'=>'Boresha kasi ya wp-admin kupitia akiba (caching). (Inaweza kukutana na data iliyoisha muda wake)','When enabled, the cache will automatically purge when any plugin, theme or the WordPress core is upgraded.'=>'Wakati umewashwa, akiba itajifuta kiatomati wakati programu-jalizi yoyote, mada au msingi wa WordPress utakaposasishwa.','Cloudflare Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya Cloudflare','Use %s API functionality.'=>'Tumia kipengele cha API cha %s.','Global API Key / API Token'=>'Ufunguo wa API wa Ulimwenguni Pote / Tokeni ya API','Your API key / token is used to access %s APIs.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa API / tokeni inatumika kupata ufikiaji wa API za %s.','Get it from %s.'=>'Ipate kutoka %s.','Recommended to generate the token from Cloudflare API token template "WordPress".'=>'Inapendekezwa kutengeneza tokeni kutoka kwa kiolezo cha tokeni ya API ya Cloudflare "WordPress".','Email Address'=>'Anwani ya Barua Pepe','Your Email address on %s.'=>'Anwani yako ya barua pepe kwenye %s.','Optional when API token used.'=>'Si lazima wakati tokeni ya API inatumika.','Domain'=>'Domain','You can just type part of the domain.'=>'Unaweza kuandika sehemu tu ya kikoa.','Once saved, it will be matched with the current list and completed automatically.'=>'Ikihifadhiwa tu, italinganishwa na orodha ya sasa na kukamilishwa kiotomatiki.','Clear %s cache when "Purge All" is run.'=>'Futa akiba ya %s wakati "Safisha Zote" inapoendeshwa.','To enable the following functionality, turn ON Cloudflare API in CDN Settings.'=>'Ili kuwezesha utendakazi ufuatao, washa Cloudflare API katika Mipangilio ya CDN.','Cloudflare Domain'=>'Domain ya Cloudflare','Cloudflare Zone'=>'Ukanda wa Cloudflare','Development Mode'=>'Hali ya Ukuzaji','Turn ON'=>'Washa','Turn OFF'=>'Zima','Check Status'=>'Angalia Hali','Current status is %1$s since %2$s.'=>'Hali ya sasa ni %1$s tangu %2$s.','Current status is %s.'=>'Hali ya sasa ni %s.','Development mode will be automatically turned off in %s.'=>'Hali ya uundaji itazimwa kiotomatiki baada ya %s.','Temporarily bypass Cloudflare cache. This allows changes to the origin server to be seen in realtime.'=>'Pitia kwa muda kashe ya Cloudflare. Hii inaruhusu mabadiliko kwenye seva asili kuonekana kwa wakati halisi.','Development Mode will be turned off automatically after three hours.'=>'Hali ya Maendeleo itazimwa kiotomatiki baada ya saa tatu.','%1$sLearn More%2$s'=>'%1$sJifunze Zaidi%2$s','Cloudflare Cache'=>'Kache ya Cloudflare','Purge Everything'=>'Futa Kila Kitu','Other Static CDN'=>'CDN Nyingine ya Kudumu','Zinn® Cache Engine CDN'=>'Injini ya Zinn® Cache CDN','CDN Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya CDN','Turn this setting %s if you are using a traditional Content Delivery Network (CDN) or a subdomain for static content.'=>'Weka mpangilio huu uwe %s ikiwa unatumia Mtandao wa Jadi wa Kusambaza Maudhui (CDN) au kikoa kidogo cha maudhui tuli.','NOTE: Cloudflare does not use CDN Mapping. If you are only using Cloudflare, leave this setting %s.'=>'KUMBUKA: Cloudflare haitumii Ramani ya CDN. Ikiwa unatumia Cloudflare pekee, acha mpangilio huu ukiwa %s.','To randomize CDN hostname, define multiple hostnames for the same resources.'=>'Ili kubadilisha jina la mwenyeji la CDN kwa nasibu, fafanua majina mengi ya mwenyeji kwa rasilimali zile zile.','Serve all image files through the CDN. This will affect all attachments, HTML %1$s tags, and CSS %2$s attributes.'=>'Hudumia faili zote za picha kupitia CDN. Hii itaathiri viambatisho vyote, vitambulisho vya HTML vya %1$s, na sifa za CSS za %2$s.','Serve all CSS files through the CDN. This will affect all enqueued WP CSS files.'=>'Toa faili zote za CSS kupitia CDN. Hii itaathiri faili zote za WP CSS zilizowekwa kwenye foleni.','Serve all JavaScript files through the CDN. This will affect all enqueued WP JavaScript files.'=>'Tuma faili zote za JavaScript kupitia CDN. Hii itaathiri faili zote za WP JavaScript zilizowekwa kwenye foleni.','Static file type links to be replaced by CDN links.'=>'Viungo vya aina ya faili tuli vitabadilishwa na viungo vya CDN.','This will affect all tags containing attributes: %s.'=>'Hii itaathiri lebo zote zenye sifa: %s.','If you turn any of the above settings OFF, please remove the related file types from the %s box.'=>'Ukizima mojawapo ya mipangilio iliyo hapo juu, tafadhali ondoa aina za faili zinazohusiana kutoka kwenye kisanduku cha %s.','Specify which HTML element attributes will be replaced with CDN Mapping.'=>'Taja ni sifa zipi za kipengele cha HTML zitakazobadilishwa na Ramani ya CDN.','Only attributes listed here will be replaced.'=>'Ni sifa zilizoorodheshwa hapa pekee zitakazobadilishwa.','Use the format %1$s or %2$s (element is optional).'=>'Tumia muundo wa %1$s au %2$s (kipengele si cha lazima).','Site URL to be served through the CDN. Beginning with %1$s. For example, %2$s.'=>'URL ya Tovuti itakayohudumiwa kupitia CDN. Inaanza na %1$s. Kwa mfano, %2$s.','Only files within these directories will be pointed to the CDN.'=>'Ni faili zilizomo ndani ya saraka hizi pekee ndizo zitakazoelekezwa kwenye CDN.','Paths containing these strings will not be served from the CDN.'=>'Njia zilizo na mifuatano hii hazitatolewa kutoka kwa CDN.','Are you sure to delete all existing blocklist items?'=>'Una uhakika wa kufuta vipengele vyote vya orodha iliyozuiwa vilivyopo?','Empty blocklist'=>'Orodha ya waliopigwa marufuku tupu','Blocklist'=>'Orodha ya waliopigwa marufuku','Total'=>'Jumla','URL'=>'URL','Operation'=>'Shughuli','Remove from Blocklist'=>'Ondoa kwenye Orodha Iliyozuiwa','API: PHP Constant %s available to disable blocklist.'=>'API: Kigezo cha PHP %s kinapatikana ili kuzima orodha iliyozuiwa.','API: Filter %s available to disable blocklist.'=>'API: Kichujio %s kinapatikana ili kuzima orodha ya uzuiaji.','Not blocklisted'=>'Haiorodheshwa kwenye orodha nyeusi','Blocklisted due to not cacheable'=>'Imewekwa kwenye orodha iliyozuiwa kwa sababu haiwezi kuwekwa kwenye akiba (cache)','Blocklisted'=>'Orodha nyeusi','Summary'=>'Muhtasari','Map'=>'Ramani','Zinn® Cache Engine Crawler'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine Crawler','Clean Crawler Map'=>'Safisha Ramani ya Kizungumkuti','Refresh Crawler Map'=>'Sasisha Ramani ya Kitambaa','Generated at %s'=>'Imetolewa saa %s','Sitemap List'=>'Orodha ya Ramani ya Tovuti','Sitemap Total'=>'Jumla ya Ramani ya Tovuti','URL Search'=>'Utafutaji wa URL','Cache Hit'=>'Kumbukumbu Iliyopatikana','Cache Miss'=>'Kukosa Akiba','Crawler Status'=>'Hali ya Kidhibiti cha Tovuti','Add to Blocklist'=>'Ongeza kwenye Orodha Iliyozuiwa','Crawler General Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya Jumla ya Kitambaa cha Wavuti','This will enable crawler cron.'=>'Hii itawezesha cron ya kitambaa.','Specify how long in seconds before the crawler should initiate crawling the entire sitemap again.'=>'Bainisha muda katika sekunde kabla ya kitambaa cha mtandao kuanza kutambaa kwenye ramani nzima ya tovuti tena.','The crawler will use your XML sitemap or sitemap index. Enter the full URL to your sitemap here.'=>'Kitafuta-tovuti kitatumia ramani yako ya tovuti ya XML au faharasa ya ramani ya tovuti. Weka URL kamili ya ramani yako ya tovuti hapa.','The maximum average server load allowed while crawling. The number of crawler threads in use will be actively reduced until average server load falls under this limit. If this cannot be achieved with a single thread, the current crawler run will be terminated.'=>'Kiwango cha juu cha wastani wa mzigo wa seva kinachoruhusiwa wakati wa kutambaza. Idadi ya nyuzi za kitambazaji zinazotumika itapunguzwa kikamilifu hadi wastani wa mzigo wa seva utakaposhuka chini ya kikomo hiki. Ikiwa hili haliwezi kufikiwa kwa uzi mmoja, uendeshaji wa sasa wa kitambazaji utakatishwa.','Server enforced value: %s'=>'Thamani inayotekelezwa na seva: %s','Server allowed max value: %s'=>'Kiwango cha juu kinachoruhusiwa na seva: %s','To crawl the site as a logged-in user, enter the user ids to be simulated.'=>'Ili kutambaa kwenye tovuti kama mtumiaji aliyeingia, weka vitambulisho vya watumiaji vitakavyoigwa.','You must set %s before using this feature.'=>'Lazima uweke %s kabla ya kutumia kipengele hiki.','Click here to set.'=>'Bofya hapa ili kuweka.','You must set %1$s to %2$s before using this feature.'=>'Lazima uweke %1$s kuwa %2$s kabla ya kutumia kipengele hiki.','To crawl for a particular cookie, enter the cookie name, and the values you wish to crawl for. Values should be one per line. There will be one crawler created per cookie value, per simulated role.'=>'Ili kutafuta kuki mahususi, weka jina la kuki, na thamani unazotaka kutafuta. Thamani zinapaswa kuwa moja kwa kila mstari. Kutakuwa na kitafuta kuki kimoja kitakachoundwa kwa kila thamani ya kuki, kwa kila jukumu lililoigwa.','Use %1$s in %2$s to indicate this cookie has not been set.'=>'Tumia %1$s katika %2$s kuonyesha kwamba kuki hii haijawekwa.','You need to set the %s in Settings first before using the crawler'=>'Unahitaji kuweka %s katika Mipangilio kwanza kabla ya kutumia kitambaa cha tovuti','Crawler Cron'=>'Kromu ya Kitambazaji','The crawler feature is not enabled on the LiteSpeed server. Please consult your server admin or hosting provider.'=>'Kipengele cha kitambaa (crawler) hakijawashwa kwenye seva ya LiteSpeed. Tafadhali wasiliana na msimamizi wako wa seva au mtoa huduma wa mwenyeji (hosting provider).','See %sIntroduction for Enabling the Crawler%s for detailed information.'=>'Tazama %sUtangulizi wa Kuwezesha Kifuatiliaji%s kwa maelezo ya kina.','Current sitemap crawl started at'=>'Ukaguzi wa sitemap ya sasa umeanza saa','The next complete sitemap crawl will start at'=>'Ukaguzi kamili wa sitemap unaofuata utaanza saa','Last complete run time for all crawlers'=>'Muda wa mwisho wa kukamilisha kwa vitambaa vyote vya wavuti','%d seconds'=>'sekunde %d','Run time for previous crawler'=>'Muda wa utekelezaji wa mtambaji wa awali','Current crawler started at'=>'Kipitishaji cha sasa kilianza saa','Current server load'=>'Mzigo wa seva wa sasa','Last interval'=>'Muda uliopita','Ended reason'=>'Sababu ya kumalizika','Last crawled'=>'Ilitafutwa mwisho','%d item(s)'=>'Vipengele %d','Reset position'=>'Weka upya nafasi','Manually run'=>'Endesha wewe mwenyewe','Cron Name'=>'Jina la Cron','Run Frequency'=>'Mara kwa Mara ya Kuendesha','Activate'=>'Amsha','Running'=>'Inafanya kazi','Waiting'=>'Inasubiri','Hit'=>'Idadi ya wageni','Miss'=>'Amisi','Position: '=>'Nafasi:','running'=>'inaendelea','Waiting to be Crawled'=>'Inasubiri kukaguliwa','Already Cached'=>'Tayari Imehifadhiwa Kwenye Akiba','Successfully Crawled'=>'Imefagiwa kwa Mafanikio','Run frequency is set by the Interval Between Runs setting.'=>'Mzunguko wa kuendesha umewekwa na mpangilio wa Muda Kati ya Mzunguko.','Crawlers cannot run concurrently. If both the cron and a manual run start at similar times, the first to be started will take precedence.'=>'Vigae vya kutambaa haviwezi kuendeshwa kwa wakati mmoja. Ikiwa kikosi kazi cha cron na uendeshaji wa mikono vitaanza kwa nyakati zinazofanana, kilichoanza kwanza kitapewa kipaumbele.','Please see %sHooking WP-Cron Into the System Task Scheduler%s to learn how to create the system cron task.'=>'Tafadhali rejelea %sHooking WP-Cron Into the System Task Scheduler%s ili kujifunza jinsi ya kuunda kazi ya mfumo wa cron.','Watch Crawler Status'=>'Angalia Hali ya Kipepeo cha Wavuti','Show crawler status'=>'Onyesha hali ya kitembezi','Start watching...'=>'Anza kutazama...','No crawler meta file generated yet'=>'Hakuna faili la meta la kitambaa (crawler) lililozalishwa bado','Cache Status'=>'Hali ya Akiba','More'=>'Zaidi','Public Cache'=>'Kache ya Umma','Private Cache'=>'Kache ya Kibinafsi','Crawler(s)'=>'Kipitio (Vipitio)','Currently active crawler'=>'Kitambaa kinachofanya kazi kwa sasa','%1$s %2$d item(s)'=>'%1$s bidhaa %2$d','Last crawled:'=>'Ilichungwa mwisho:','News'=>'Habari','Network Dashboard'=>'Dashibodi ya Mtandao','Zinn® Cache Engine Dashboard'=>'Dashibodi ya Zinn® Cache Engine','Usage Statistics: %s'=>'Takwimu za Matumizi: %s','CDN Bandwidth'=>'Mtandao wa CDN Bandwidth','Low Quality Image Placeholder'=>'Kibadilishaji cha Picha ya Ubora wa Chini','Fast Queue Usage'=>'Matumizi ya Foleni ya Haraka','Usage'=>'Matumizi','Pay as You Go'=>'Lipia Kadiri Unavyotumia','PAYG Balance'=>'Salio la PAYG','This Month Usage: %s'=>'Matumizi ya Mwezi Huu: %s','Pay as You Go Usage Statistics'=>'Takwimu za Matumizi ya Kulipia Unapotumia','Total Usage'=>'Matumizi ya Jumla','Total images optimized in this month'=>'Jumla ya picha zilizoboreshwa mwezi huu','DB Optimization Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya Uboreshaji wa DB','Zinn® Cache Engine Database Optimization'=>'Uboreshaji wa Hifadhidata ya Injini ya Akiba ya Zinn®','Clean All'=>'Safisha Zote','Post Revisions'=>'Marekebisho ya Chapisho','Clean all post revisions'=>'Safisha masahihisho yote ya machapisho','Orphaned Post Meta'=>'Meta za Machapisho Zilizotelekezwa','Clean all orphaned post meta records'=>'Safisha rekodi zote za meta za machapisho yaliyoachwa yatima','Auto Drafts'=>'Rasimu Otomatiki','Clean all auto saved drafts'=>'Futa rasimu zote zilizohifadhiwa kiotomatiki','Trashed Posts'=>'Machapisho yaliyofutwa','Clean all trashed posts and pages'=>'Futa machapisho na kurasa zote zilizotupwa kwenye tupio','Spam Comments'=>'Maoni Takaataka','Clean all spam comments'=>'Futa maoni yote taka','Trashed Comments'=>'Maoni Yaliyofutwa','Clean all trashed comments'=>'Safisha maoni yote yaliyofutwa','Trackbacks/Pingbacks'=>'Marejeo ya nyuma/Pingbacks','Clean all trackbacks and pingbacks'=>'Safisha marejeleo na maoni yote ya pingback','Expired Transients'=>'Vizuvi Vilivyokwisha Muda Wake','Clean expired transient options'=>'Safisha chaguo za muda zilizoisha muda wake','All Transients'=>'Vidokezo Vyote Vya Muda','Clean all transient options'=>'Futa chaguo zote za muda mfupi','Optimize Tables'=>'Boresha Majedwali','Optimize all tables in your database'=>'Boresha jedwali zote kwenye hifadhidata yako','Clean revisions older than %1$s day(s), excluding %2$s latest revisions'=>'Safisha marekebisho ya zamani kuliko siku %1$s, ukiondoa marekebisho %2$s ya hivi karibuni','Database Optimizer'=>'Kiboreshaji cha Hifadhidata','Database Table Engine Converter'=>'Kibadilishaji cha Injini ya Jedwali la Hifadhidata','Table'=>'Jedwali','Engine'=>'Injini','Tool'=>'Zana','Convert to InnoDB'=>'Badilisha kuwa InnoDB','We are good. No table uses MyISAM engine.'=>'Tuko sawa. Hakuna jedwali linalotumia injini ya MyISAM.','Database Summary'=>'Muhtasari wa Hifadhidata','Autoload size'=>'Ukubwa wa upakiaji wa kiotomatiki','Autoload entries'=>'Ingizo za kupakia kiotomatiki','Autoload top list'=>'Orodha ya juu ya upakiaji otomatiki','Option Name'=>'Jina la Chaguo','Autoload'=>'Upakiaji otomatiki','Size'=>'Ukubwa','Specify the number of most recent revisions to keep when cleaning revisions.'=>'Ainisha idadi ya masahihisho ya hivi karibuni ya kuweka wakati wa kusafisha masahihisho.','Day(s)'=>'Siku','Revisions newer than this many days will be kept when cleaning revisions.'=>'Mabadiliko mapya kuliko idadi hii ya siku yatahifadhiwa wakati wa kusafisha mabadiliko.','Public'=>'Umma','Private'=>'Faragha','Disable'=>'Zima','Widget Cache TTL'=>'Muda wa Uhai wa Kache ya Wijeti','Recommended value: 28800 seconds (8 hours).'=>'Thamani inayopendekezwa: sekunde 28800 (saa 8).','A TTL of 0 indicates do not cache.'=>'TTL ya 0 inaonyesha usihifadhi kwenye kache.','General Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya Jumla','Zinn® Cache Engine General Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya Jumla ya Injini ya Akiba ya Zinn®','Use Primary Site Configuration'=>'Tumia Sanfiguration Kuu ya Tovuti','Check this option to use the primary site\'s configuration for all subsites.'=>'Weka alama kwenye chaguo hili ili kutumia usanidi wa tovuti kuu kwa tovuti zote ndogo.','This will disable the settings page on all subsites.'=>'Hii itazima ukurasa wa mipangilio kwenye tovuti zote ndogo.','This option enables maximum optimization for Guest Mode visitors.'=>'Chaguo hili linawezesha uboreshaji wa juu zaidi kwa wageni wa Hali ya Mgeni.','Please read all warnings before enabling this option.'=>'Tafadhali soma maonyo yote kabla ya kuwezesha chaguo hili.','Notice'=>'Ilani','%s must be turned ON for this setting to work.'=>'%s lazima iwashwe ili mpangilio huu ufanye kazi.','You need to turn %s on to get maximum result.'=>'Unahitaji kuwasha %s ili upate matokeo ya juu zaidi.','You need to turn %s on and finish all WebP generation to get maximum result.'=>'Unahitaji kuwasha %s na kumaliza utengenezaji wote wa WebP ili kupata matokeo ya juu zaidi.','Enter this site\'s IP address to allow cloud services directly call IP instead of domain name. This eliminates the overhead of DNS and CDN lookups.'=>'Weka anwani ya IP ya tovuti hii ili kuruhusu huduma za wingu ziite IP moja kwa moja badala ya jina la kikoa. Hii inaondoa mzigo mkubwa wa utafutaji wa DNS na CDN.','Your server IP'=>'IP ya seva yako','Check my public IP from'=>'Angalia IP yangu ya umma kutoka','the auto-detected IP may not be accurate if you have an additional outgoing IP set, or you have multiple IPs configured on your server.'=>'IP iliyotambuliwa kiotomatiki huenda isisiwe sahihi ikiwa una anwani nyingine ya IP inayotoka iliyowekwa, au una anwani nyingi za IP zilizosanidiwa kwenye seva yako.','Please make sure this IP is the correct one for visiting your site.'=>'Tafadhali hakikisha kuwa anwani hii ya IP ndiyo sahihi kwa ajili ya kutembelea tovuti yako.','Turn this option ON to show latest news automatically, including hotfixes, new releases, available beta versions, and promotions.'=>'Washa chaguo hili ili kuonyesha habari za hivi punde kiotomatiki, ikiwa ni pamoja na marekebisho ya haraka, matoleo mapya, matoleo ya beta yanayopatikana, na matangazo.','Turn this option ON to have Zinn® Cache Engine updated automatically, whenever a new version is released. If OFF, update manually as usual.'=>'Washa chaguo hili ili Zinn® Cache Engine isasishwe kiotomatiki, kila toleo jipya linapotolewa. Ikiwa IMEZIMWA, sasisha wewe mwenyewe kama kawaida.','Guest Mode provides an always cacheable landing page for an automated guest\'s first time visit, and then attempts to update cache varies via AJAX.'=>'Hali ya Mgeni inatoa ukurasa wa kuwasili unaoweza kuhifadhiwa kwenye akiba kila wakati kwa ajili ya ziara ya kwanza ya mgeni aliyekuja kiotomatiki, na kisha inajaribu kusasisha tofauti za akiba kupitia AJAX.','This option can help to correct the cache vary for certain advanced mobile or tablet visitors.'=>'Chaguo hili linaweza kusaidia kurekebisha tofauti ya kache kwa wageni fulani wa hali ya juu wa simu au kompyuta kibao.','Guest Mode testing result'=>'Matokeo ya majaribio ya Hali ya Mgeni','Testing'=>'Inafanya jaribio','Guest Mode IP/UA sync status'=>'Hali ya kusawazisha ya IP/UA ya Hali ya Mgeni','Syncing'=>'Inasawazisha','Guest Mode passed testing.'=>'Hali ya Wageni imefaulu majaribio.','Guest Mode failed to test.'=>'Hali ya Wageni imeshindwa kufanyiwa majaribio.','Synced successfully.'=>'Imesawazishwa kikamilifu.','Sync failed.'=>'Usawazishaji umeshindwa.','Image Optimization Summary'=>'Muhtasari wa Uboreshaji wa Picha','Image Optimization Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya Uboreshaji wa Picha','Zinn® Cache Engine Image Optimization'=>'Uboreshaji wa Picha wa Zinn® Cache Engine','Request WebP/AVIF versions of original images when doing optimization.'=>'Omba matoleo ya WebP/AVIF ya picha halisi wakati wa kufanya uboreshaji.','Significantly improve load time by replacing images with their optimized %s versions.'=>'Boresha sana wakati wa kupakia kwa kubadilisha picha ziwe matoleo yaliyoboreshwa ya %s.','When switching formats, please %1$s or %2$s to apply this new choice to previously optimized images.'=>'Unapobadilisha miundo, tafadhali tumia %1$s au %2$s ili kutumia chaguo h இந்தப் jipya kwenye picha zilizoboreshwa awali.','Destroy All Optimization Data'=>'Futa Data Zote za Uboreshaji','Soft Reset Optimization Counter'=>'Kipingajio cha Uboreshaji wa Kuweka Upya kwa Upole','Automatically request optimization via cron job.'=>'Omba maboresho kiotomatiki kupitia cron job.','Optimize images and save backups of the originals in the same folder.'=>'Boresha picha na uhifadhi nakala za asili kwenye folda ileile.','Automatically remove the original image backups after fetching optimized images.'=>'Ondoa kiotomatiki nakala rudufu za picha asili baada ya kuleta picha zilizoboreshwa.','This is irreversible.'=>'Hili haliwezi kutenduliwa.','You will be unable to Revert Optimization once the backups are deleted!'=>'Hutaweza Kutengua Uboreshaji mara tu nakala rudufu zitakapofutwa!','Optimize images using lossless compression.'=>'Boresha picha ukitumia mfinyazo usioteza ubora.','This can improve quality but may result in larger images than lossy compression will.'=>'Hii inaweza kuboresha ubora lakini inaweza kusababisha picha kuwa kubwa zaidi kuliko kubana bila uhifadhi kamili kutakavyofanya.','No sizes found.'=>'Hakuna saizi zilizopatikana.','Choose which image sizes to optimize.'=>'Chagua ukubwa wa picha za kuboresha.','Preserve EXIF data (copyright, GPS, comments, keywords, etc) when optimizing.'=>'Hifadhi data ya EXIF (haki miliki, GPS, maoni, maneno muhimu, n.k.) wakati wa kuboresha.','This will increase the size of optimized files.'=>'Hii itaongeza ukubwa wa faili zilizoboreshwa.','Specify which element attributes will be replaced with WebP/AVIF.'=>'Bainisha sifa za elementi zipi zitabadilishwa na WebP/AVIF.','Enable replacement of WebP/AVIF in %s elements that were generated outside of WordPress logic.'=>'Wezesha uingizwaji wa WebP/AVIF katika vipengele vya %s ambavyo vilitolewa nje ya mantiki ya WordPress.','Current closest Cloud server is %s. Click to redetect.'=>'Seva ya karibu zaidi ya Wingu kwa sasa ni %s. Bonyeza ili utafute upya.','Are you sure you want to redetect the closest cloud server for this service?'=>'Una uhakika kuwa unataka kugundua upya seva ya wingu iliyo karibu zaidi kwa huduma hii?','Redetect'=>'Gundua Upya','Image optimisation'=>'Uboreshaji wa picha','You can request a maximum of %s images at once.'=>'Unaweza kuomba upeo wa picha %s kwa wakati mmoja.','To make sure our server can communicate with your server without any issues and everything works fine, for the few first requests the number of image groups allowed in a single request is limited.'=>'Ili kuhakikisha seva yetu inaweza kuwasiliana na seva yako bila tatizo lolote na kila kitu kinafanya vizuri, kwa maombi machache ya kwanza idadi ya vikundi vya picha vinavyoruhusiwa katika ombi moja ni kidogo.','Current limit is'=>'Kikomo cha sasa ni','Send Optimization Request'=>'Tuma Ombi la Uboreshaji','Available after %d second(s)'=>'Inapatikana baada ya sekunde %d','Only press the button if the pull cron job is disabled.'=>'Bonyeza kitufe hiki tu ikiwa kazi ya cron ya kuvuta imezimwa.','Images will be pulled automatically if the cron job is running.'=>'Picha zitachukuliwa kiotomatiki ikiwa kazi ya cron inaendelea.','Pull Images'=>'Vuta Picha','Optimization Status'=>'Hali ya Uboreshaji','When the optimisation server finishes, it notifies your site to pull the optimised images.'=>'Seva ya uboreshaji inapomalika, inaarifu tovuti yako kuvuta picha zilizoboreshwa.','This process is automatic.'=>'Mchakato huu ni wa kiotomatiki.','Last pull initiated by cron at %s.'=>'Kivutio cha mwisho kilianzishwa na cron saa %s.','Storage Optimization'=>'Uboreshaji wa Hifadhi','A backup of each image is saved before it is optimized.'=>'Nakala rudufu ya kila picha inahifadhiwa kabla haijaboreshwa.','Last calculated'=>'Imehesabiwa mwisho','Files'=>'Faili','Calculate Original Image Storage'=>'Hesabu Uhifadhi Halisi wa Picha','Calculate Backups Disk Space'=>'Hesabu Nafasi ya Diski ya Nakala Rudufu','Image Thumbnail Group Sizes'=>'Ukubwa wa Vikundi vya Picha Ndogo','Delete all backups of the original images'=>'Futa nakala rudufu zote za picha asili','Last ran'=>'Iliyowekwa mwisho','Saved'=>'Imehofadhiwa','Are you sure you want to remove all image backups?'=>'Una uhakika unataka kuondoa nakala rudufu zote za picha?','Remove Original Image Backups'=>'Odoa Nakala Halisi za Hifadhi (Backups) za Awali','Image Information'=>'Maelezo ya Picha','Image groups total'=>'Jumla ya vikundi vya picha','Congratulations, all gathered!'=>'Hongera, yote yamekamilika!','What is a group?'=>'Kundi ni nini?','What is an image group?'=>'Kundi la picha ni nini?','Current image post id position'=>'Nafasi ya sasa ya kitambulisho cha chapisho la picha','Maximum image post id'=>'Kitambulisho cha juu cha chapisho la picha','Scan for any new unoptimized image thumbnail sizes and resend necessary image optimization requests.'=>'Changanua saizi zote mpya za vijipicha vya picha ambazo hazijaboreshwa na utume tena maombi yanayohitajika ya kuboresha picha.','Rescan New Thumbnails'=>'Changanua Vijipicha Vipya','Optimization Summary'=>'Muhtasari wa Uboreshaji','Total Reduction'=>'Jumla ya Punguzo','Images Pulled'=>'Picha Zilizochotwa','Last Request'=>'Ombi la Mwisho','Last Pulled'=>'Ilivutwa Mwisho','Results can be checked in %sMedia Library%s.'=>'Matokeo yanaweza kuangaliwa katika %sMedia Library%s.','Optimization Tools'=>'Zana za Kuongeza Ufanisi','You can quickly switch between using original (unoptimized versions) and optimized image files. It will affect all images on your website, both regular and webp versions if available.'=>'Unaweza kubadilisha haraka kati ya kutumia faili za picha za asili (zisizoboreshwa) na zilizoboreshwa. Hii itaathiri picha zote kwenye tovuti yako, matoleo ya kawaida na ya webp ikiwa yanapatikana.','Use original images (unoptimized) on your site'=>'Tumia picha halisi (zisizoboreshwa) kwenye tovuti yako','Use Original Files'=>'Tumia Faili za Asili','Switch back to using optimized images on your site'=>'Badili ujeruhi kurudi kwenye kutumia picha zilizoboreshwa kwenye tovuti yako','Use Optimized Files'=>'Tumia Faili Zilizoboreshwa','This will reset the %1$s. If you changed WebP/AVIF settings and want to generate %2$s for the previously optimized images, use this action.'=>'Hii itaweka upya %1$s. Ikiwa ulibadilisha mipangilio ya WebP/AVIF na unataka kutengeneza %2$s kwa picha zilizoboreshwa hapo awali, tumia kitendo hiki.','Are you sure to destroy all optimized images?'=>'Je, una uhakika wa kuharibu picha zote zilizoboreshwa?','Remove all previous image optimization requests/results, revert completed optimizations, and delete all optimization files.'=>'Ondoa maombi/matokeo yote ya awali ya uboreshaji wa picha, rudisha uboreshaji uliokamilishwa, na ufute faili zote za uboreshaji.','Read the upstream Zinn® Cache Engine documentation'=>'Soma nyaraka za mfumo wa juu wa Zinn® Cache Engine','Zinn Digital® support'=>'Usaidizi wa Zinn Digital®','Zinn® Cache Engine user guide'=>'Mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa Zinn® Cache Engine','To use the caching functions you must have a LiteSpeed or OpenLiteSpeed web server with the LSCache module.'=>'Ili kutumia vipengele vya kuweka akiba lazima uwe na seva ya mtandao ya LiteSpeed au OpenLiteSpeed yenye moduli ya LSCache.','Please enable the LSCache Module at the server level, or ask your hosting provider.'=>'Tafadhali wezesha Moduli ya LSCache kwenye kiwango cha seva, au umuulize mtoa huduma wako wa kukaribisha tovuti.','Please enable Zinn® Cache Engine in the plugin settings.'=>'Tafadhali wezesha Zinn® Cache Engine katika mipangilio ya programu-jalizi.','LSCache caching functions on this page are currently unavailable!'=>'Vitendaji vya kache vya LSCache kwenye ukurasa huu havipatikani kwa sasa!','The network admin selected use primary site configs for all subsites.'=>'Msimamizi wa mtandao alichagua kutumia mipangilio ya tovuti kuu kwa tovuti zote ndogo.','The following options are selected, but are not editable in this settings page.'=>'Chaguo zifuatazo zimechaguliwa, lakini haziwezi kuhaririwa katika ukurasa huu wa mipangilio.','LiteSpeed cache plugin upgraded. Please refresh the page to complete the configuration data upgrade.'=>'Plugin ya kache ya LiteSpeed imesasishwa. Tafadhali onyesha upya ukurasa ili kukamilisha usasishaji wa data ya usanidi.','Deactivate Zinn® Cache Engine'=>'Zima Injini ya Akiba ya Zinn®','The deactivation is temporary'=>'Kuzima huku ni kwa muda mfupi','Site performance is worse'=>'Utendaji wa tovuti ni mbaya zaidi','Plugin is too complicated'=>'Plugin ni ngumu sana','Other'=>'Nyingine','Why are you deactivating the plugin?'=>'Kwa nini unalemaza programu-jalizi hii?','On uninstall, all plugin settings will be deleted.'=>'Wakati wa kuondoa, mipangilio yote ya programu-jalizi itafutwa.','If you have used Image Optimization, please %sDestroy All Optimization Data%s first. NOTE: this does not remove your optimized images.'=>'Ikiwa umetumia Uboreshaji wa Picha, tafadhali kwanza %sAngamiza Data Yote ya Uboreshaji%s. KUMBUKA: hii haiondoi picha zako zilizoboreshwa.','Deactivate'=>'Zima','Deactivate plugin'=>'Zima programu-jalizi','Close popup'=>'Funga dirisha ibukizi','Zinn® Cache Engine plugin is installed!'=>'Plugin ya Zinn® Cache Engine imesanikishwa!','This message indicates that the plugin was installed by the server admin.'=>'Ujumbe huu unaonyesha kwamba programu-jalizi ilisanikishwa na msimamizi wa seva.','The Zinn® Cache Engine plugin is used to cache pages - a simple way to improve the performance of the site.'=>'Plugin ya Zinn® Cache Engine inatumiwa kuhifadhi kurasa kwenye kache - njia rahisi ya kuboresha utendaji wa tovuti.','However, there is no way of knowing all the possible customizations that were implemented.'=>'Hata hivyo, hakuna njia ya kujua ubinafsishaji wote unaowezekana uliotekelezwa.','For that reason, please test the site to make sure everything still functions properly.'=>'Kwa sababu hiyo, tafadhali jaribu tovuti ili kuhakikisha kuwa kila kitu kinafanya kazi vizuri bado.','Examples of test cases include:'=>'Mifano ya kesi za majaribio inajumuisha:','Visit the site while logged out.'=>'Tembelea tovuti ukiwa umetoka kwenye akaunti yako.','Create a post, make sure the front page is accurate.'=>'Tengeneza chapisho, hakikisha ukurasa wa mbele ni sahihi.','If there are any questions, the team is always happy to answer any questions on the %ssupport forum%s.'=>'Ikiwa kuna maswali yoyote, timu daima inafurahi kujibu swali lolote kwenye %sjukwaa la usaidizi%s.','If you would rather not move at litespeed, you can deactivate this plugin.'=>'Ikiwa unapendelea kutumia mfumo mwingine badala ya litespeed, unaweza kuzima programu-jalizi hii.','NOTICE: Database login cookie did not match your login cookie.'=>'TANGAZO: Kuki ya kuingia kwenye hifadhidata haikulingana na kuki yako ya kuingia.','If the login cookie was recently changed in the settings, please log out and back in.'=>'Kuki ya kuingia ikiwa ilibadilishwa hivi karibuni katika mipangilio, tafadhali toka nje na uingie tena.','If not, please verify the setting in the %sAdvanced tab%s.'=>'Ikiwa sivyo, tafadhali thibitisha mpangilio kwenye kichupo cha %sAdvanced tab%s.','If using OpenLiteSpeed, the server must be restarted once for the changes to take effect.'=>'Kama unatumia OpenLiteSpeed, seva lazima iwashwe upya mara moja ili mabadoko yaanze kutumika.','Unexpected cache rule %2$s found in %1$s file. This rule may cause visitors to see old versions of pages due to the browser caching HTML pages. If you are sure that HTML pages are not being browser cached, this message can be dismissed. (%3$sLearn More%4$s)'=>'Sheria ya kache isiyotarajiwa %2$s imepatikana kwenye faili la %1$s. Sheria hii inaweza kusababisha wageni kuona matoleo ya zamani ya kurasa kutokana na kivinjari kuhifadhi kache ya kurasa za HTML. Ikiwa una hakika kwamba kurasa za HTML hazihifadhiwi kache na kivinjari, ujumbe huu unaweza kupuuzwa. (%3$sJifunze Zaidi%4$s)','OptimaX Summary'=>'Muhtasari wa OptimaX','OptimaX Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya OptimaX','Zinn® Cache Engine OptimaX'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine OptimaX','Turn on OptimaX. This will automatically request your pages OptimaX result via cron job.'=>'Washa OptimaX. Hii itaomba kiotomatiki matokeo ya OptimaX ya kurasa zako kupitia kazi ya cron.','CSS Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya CSS','JS Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya JS','HTML Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya HTML','Media Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya Vyombo vya Habari','VPI'=>'VPI','Media Excludes'=>'Vyombo vya Habari Vilivyotengwa','Localization'=>'Ujanibishaji','Tuning'=>'Urekebishaji','Zinn® Cache Engine Page Optimization'=>'Uboreshaji wa Kurasa za Injini ya Akiba ya Zinn®','Please test thoroughly when enabling any option in this list. After changing Minify/Combine settings, please do a Purge All action.'=>'Tafadhali jaribu kwa makini unapowasha chaguo lolote katika orodha hii. Baada ya kubadilisha mipangilio ya Kupunguza Ukubwa (Minify)/Kuchanganya (Combine), tafadhali fanya kitendo cha Kufuta Vyote (Purge All).','Minify CSS files and inline CSS code.'=>'Punguza ukubwa wa faili za CSS na weka msimbo wa CSS ndani.','Combine CSS files and inline CSS code.'=>'Unganisha faili za CSS na msimbo wa CSS wa ndani.','How to Fix Problems Caused by CSS/JS Optimization.'=>'Jinsi ya Kurekebisha Matatizo Yanayosababishwa na Uboreshaji wa CSS/JS.','Generate unique CSS through an online generation service.'=>'Tengeneza CSS ya kipekee kupitia huduma ya utengenezaji mtandaoni.','This will drop the unused CSS on each page from the combined file.'=>'Hii itatoa CSS isiyotumika kwenye kila ukurasa kutoka kwenye faili iliyounganishwa.','Automatic generation of unique CSS is in the background via a cron-based queue.'=>'Utengenezaji otomatiki wa CSS ya kipekee unafanyika nyuma ya pazia kupitia foleni inayotegemea cron.','Filter %s available for UCSS per page type generation.'=>'Chuja %s inayopatikana kwa utengenezaji wa UCSS kwa kila aina ya ukurasa.','This option is bypassed because %1$s option is %2$s.'=>'Chaguo hاین limekwepwa kwa sababu chaguo la %1$s ni %2$s.','Last generated'=>'Imezalishwa mara ya mwisho','Last requested cost'=>'Gharama ya mwisho iliyoombwa','URL list in %s queue waiting for cron'=>'Orodha ya URL katika folongo ya %s inayongoja cron','Clear'=>'Futa','Run %s Queue Manually'=>'Endesha Foleni ya %s Kwa Mikono','Inline UCSS to reduce the extra CSS file loading. This option will not be automatically turned on for %1$s pages. To use it on %1$s pages, please set it to ON.'=>'Weka UCSS ndani kwa ndani ili kupunguza upakiaji wa faili ya ziada ya CSS. Chaguo hili halitawashwa kiotomatiki kwa kurasa za %1$s. Ili kuitumia kwenye kurasa za %1$s, tafadhali iweke iwe IMEWASHWA.','This option will automatically bypass %s option.'=>'Chaguo hili litapita kiotomatiki chaguo la %s.','Include external CSS and inline CSS in combined file when %1$s is also enabled. This option helps maintain the priorities of CSS, which should minimize potential errors caused by CSS Combine.'=>'Jumuisha CSS ya nje na CSS ya ndani kwenye faili iliyounganishwa wakati %1$s pia imewezeshwa. Chaguo hili husaidia kudumisha vipaumbele vya CSS, jambo ambalo linapaswa kupunguza makosa yanayoweza kusababishwa na Muunganisho wa CSS.','Optimize CSS delivery.'=>'Boresha uwasilishaji wa CSS.','This can improve your speed score in services like Pingdom, GTmetrix and PageSpeed.'=>'Hii inaweza kuboresha alama yako ya kasi katika huduma kama vile Pingdom, GTmetrix na PageSpeed.','Generate critical CSS through an online generation service and load the remaining CSS asynchronously.'=>'Tengeneza CSS muhimu kupitia huduma ya uzalishaji mtandaoni na upakie CSS iliyosalia kwa njia ya asynchronous.','Automatic generation of critical CSS is in the background via a cron-based queue.'=>'Utengenezaji wa kiotomatiki wa CSS muhimu unafanyika nyuma ya pazia kupitia foleni inayotegemea cron.','When this option is turned %s, it will also load Google Fonts asynchronously.'=>'Chaguo hiki linapowashwa %s, litapakia pia Google Fonts kwa njia ya asynkronous.','Elements with attribute %s in HTML code will be excluded.'=>'Vipengele vilivyo na sifa ya %s katika msimbo wa HTML vitatengwa.','This option is bypassed due to %s option.'=>'Chaguo hili linapitiwa kando kutokana na chaguo la %s.','Disable this option to generate CCSS per Post Type instead of per page. This can save significant CCSS quota, however it may result in incorrect CSS styling if your site uses a page builder.'=>'Zima chaguo hili ili kutengeneza CCSS kwa Kila Aina ya Chapisho badala ya kwa kila ukurasa. Hii inaweza kuokoa kiasi kikubwa cha rasilimali ya CCSS, hata hivyo inaweza kusababisha mtindo usio sahihi wa CSS ikiwa tovuti yako inatumia kijenzi cha kurasa.','This will inline the asynchronous CSS library to avoid render blocking.'=>'Hii itasakinisha maktaba ya CSS ya asynkrononi ndani ili kuzuia uzuiaji wa uonyeshaji.','Default'=>'Chaguo-msingi','Set this to append %1$s to all %2$s rules before caching CSS to specify how fonts should be displayed while being downloaded.'=>'Weka hii iambatanishe %1$s kwenye sheria zote za %2$s kabla ya kuhifadhi CSS ili kubainisha jinsi fonti zinapaswa kuonyeshwa wakati zinapakuliwa.','%s is recommended.'=>'%s inapendekezwa.','Swap'=>'Badilisha','Minify HTML content.'=>'Finya maudhui ya HTML.','Prefetching DNS can reduce latency for visitors.'=>'Kutabiri DNS mapema kunaweza kupunguza muda wa kusubiri kwa wageni.','For example'=>'Kwa mfano','Automatically enable DNS prefetching for all URLs in the document, including images, CSS, JavaScript, and so forth.'=>'Wezesha kiotomatiki uwekaji wa awali wa DNS kwa URL zote kwenye hati, ikiwa ni pamoja na picha, CSS, JavaScript, na kadhalika.','This can improve the page loading speed.'=>'Hii inaweza kuboresha kasi ya upakiaji wa ukurasa.','Preconnecting speeds up future loads from a given origin.'=>'Kuwasha muunganisho wa awali kunaharakisha upakiaji wa siku zijazo kutoka asili fulani.','Delay rendering off-screen HTML elements by its selector.'=>'Chelewesha uonyeshaji wa vipengele vya HTML vilivyo nje ya skrini kupitia kiteua chake.','When minifying HTML do not discard comments that match a specified pattern.'=>'Unapopunguza ukubwa wa HTML, usitupe maoni yanayolingana na muundo maalum.','If comment to be kept is like: %1$s write: %2$s'=>'Ikiwa maoni ya kuwekwa ni kama: %1$s andika: %2$s','Remove query strings from internal static resources.'=>'Ondoa vigezo vya hoja kutoka kwa rasilimali za ndani tuli.','Google reCAPTCHA will be bypassed automatically.'=>'Google reCAPTCHA itapitiwa kiotomatiki.','Append query string %s to the resources to bypass this action.'=>'Ambatisha mfuatano wa hoja %s kwenye rasilimali ili kukwepa kitendo hiki.','Use Web Font Loader library to load Google Fonts asynchronously while leaving other CSS intact.'=>'Tumia maktaba ya Web Font Loader kupakia Google Fonts kwa wakati mmoja (asynchronously) huku ukiacha CSS nyingine bila kubadilishwa.','This will also add a preconnect to Google Fonts to establish a connection earlier.'=>'Hii pia itaongeza preconnect kwa Google Fonts ili kuanzisha muunganisho mapema zaidi.','Prevent Google Fonts from loading on all pages.'=>'Zuia Google Fonts zisipakie kwenye kurasa zote.','Stop loading WordPress.org emoji. Browser default emoji will be displayed instead.'=>'Acha kupakia emoji za WordPress.org. Emoji chaguomsingi za kivinjari zitaonyeshwa badala yake.','This option will remove all %s tags from HTML.'=>'Chaguo hili litaondoa lebo zote za %s kutoka kwa HTML.','Minify JS files and inline JS codes.'=>'Fupisha faili za JS na uweke misimbo ya JS ndani.','Combine all local JS files into a single file.'=>'Unganisha faili zote za JS za ndani ziwe faili moja.','This option may result in a JS error or layout issue on frontend pages with certain themes/plugins.'=>'Chaguo hizi zinaweza kusababisha hitilafu ya JS au tatizo la mpangilio kwenye kurasa za mbele kwa mandhari/programu-jalizi fulani.','JS error can be found from the developer console of browser by right clicking and choosing Inspect.'=>'Hitilafu ya JS inaweza kupatikana kwenye dashibodi ya msanidi programu ya kivinjari kwa kubofya kulia na kuchagua Kagua.','Include external JS and inline JS in combined file when %1$s is also enabled. This option helps maintain the priorities of JS execution, which should minimize potential errors caused by JS Combine.'=>'Jumuisha JS ya nje na JS ya ndani kwenye faili iliyounganishwa wakati %1$s imewezeshwa pia. Chaguo hili hususan linasaidia kudumisha vipaumbele vya utekelezaji wa JS, jambo ambalo linapaswa kupunguza makosa yanayoweza kusababishwa na Kuunganishwa kwa JS.','Deferred'=>'Imeakhirishwa','Delayed'=>'Imerejeshwa nyuma','Deferring until page is parsed or delaying till interaction can help reduce resource contention and improve performance causing a lower FID (Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'Kuahirisha hadi ukurasa utekelezwe au kuchelewesha hadi mwingiliano kuwezekane kunaweza kusaidia kupunguza ushindani wa rasilimali na kuboresha utendaji na kusababisha FID ya chini (kipimo cha Core Web Vitals).','Failed to create Avatar table. Please follow <a %s>Table Creation guidance from LiteSpeed Wiki</a> to finish setup.'=>'Imeshindwa kuunda jedwali la Avatar. Tafadhali fuata <a %s>Mwongozo wa Kuunda Jedwali kutoka LiteSpeed Wiki</a> ili kumaliza kusanidi.','Localization Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya Lugha na Eneo','Store Gravatar locally.'=>'Hifadhi Gravatar kwenye kifaa cha karibu.','Accelerates the speed by caching Gravatar (Globally Recognized Avatars).'=>'Inaharakisha kasi kwa kuweka akiba Gravatar (Globally Recognized Avatars).','Refresh Gravatar cache by cron.'=>'Sasisha akiba ya Gravatar kupitia cron.','Avatar list in queue waiting for update'=>'Orodha ya avatari kwenye foleni zinazosubiri kusasishwa','Run Queue Manually'=>'Tekeleza Foleni Manually','Specify how long, in seconds, Gravatar files are cached.'=>'Taja muda, kwa sekunde, ambao faili za Gravatar zinahifadhiwa kwenye kache.','Localize external resources.'=>'Weka rasilimali za nje katika lugha za hapa nchini.','Please thoroughly test all items in %s to ensure they function as expected.'=>'Tafadhali jaribu kwa kina vipengele vyote katika %s ili kuhakikisha vinafanya kazi inavyotarajiwa.','Resources listed here will be copied and replaced with local URLs.'=>'Rasilimali zilizoorodheshwa hapa zitakiliwa na kubadilishwa na URL za nchini.','HTTPS sources only.'=>'Vyanzo vya HTTPS pekee.','Comments are supported. Start a line with a %s to turn it into a comment line.'=>'Maoni yanaungwa mkono. Anzisha mstari kwa %s ili kuufanya kuwa mstari wa maoni.','Example'=>'Mfano','Please thoroughly test each JS file you add to ensure it functions as expected.'=>'Tafadhali jaribu kwa kina kila faili ya JS unayoongeza ili kuhakikisha inafanya kazi inavyotarajiwa.','Load images only when they enter the viewport.'=>'Pakia picha tu wakati zinaingia kwenye eneo la kuonekana.','This can improve page loading time by reducing initial HTTP requests.'=>'Hii inaweza kuboresha muda wa kupakia kurasa kwa kupunguza maombi ya awali ya HTTP.','Adding Style to Your Lazy-Loaded Images'=>'Kuongeza Mtindo Kwenye Picha Zako Zilizopakiwa Kwanza Zinapohitajika','Specify a base64 image to be used as a simple placeholder while images finish loading.'=>'Taja picha ya base64 itakayotumika kama kishikilia nafasi rahisi wakati picha zinakamilisha kupakia.','This can be predefined in %2$s as well using constant %1$s, with this setting taking priority.'=>'Hii inaweza kufafanuliwa mapema katika %2$s pia kwa kutumia dhabiti %1$s, huku mpangilio huu ukipewa kipaumbele.','By default a gray image placeholder %s will be used.'=>'Kwa chaguo-msingi kiboreshaji cha picha ya kijivu %s kitatumika.','For example, %s can be used for a transparent placeholder.'=>'Kwa mfano, %s inaweza kutumika kwa kibambo cha nafasi kilicho wazi.','Responsive image placeholders can help to reduce layout reshuffle when images are loaded.'=>'Vipicha vya picha vinavyoitikia vinaweza kusaidia kupunguza kubadilika kwa muundo picha zinapopakiwa.','This will generate the placeholder with same dimensions as the image if it has the width and height attributes.'=>'Hii itazalisha kishikilia-nafasi chenye vipimo sawa na vya picha ikiwa ina sifa za upana na urefu.','Specify an SVG to be used as a placeholder when generating locally.'=>'Taja SVG itakayotumika kama kishikilia nafasi wakati wa kutengeneza ndani ya kifaa chako.','It will be converted to a base64 SVG placeholder on-the-fly.'=>'Itageuzwa kuwa kibakizo cha base64 SVG papo hapo.','Variables %s will be replaced with the corresponding image properties.'=>'Vigezo %s vitabadilishwa na sifa zinazolingana za picha.','Variables %s will be replaced with the configured background color.'=>'Vigezo %s vitabadilishwa na rangi ya mandharinyuma iliyowekwa.','Specify the responsive placeholder SVG color.'=>'Bainisha rangi ya SVG ya kishikiliaji kinachoitikia.','Generate Low Quality Image Placeholders through an online generation service, for responsive image previews while loading.'=>'Tengeneza Vibadala vya Picha za Ubora wa Chini kupitia huduma ya uzalishaji mtandaoni, kwa ajili ya hakikisho la picha zinazojirekebisha wakati wa kupakia.','Keep this off to use plain color placeholders.'=>'Weka hii imezima ili kutumia vishikilia nafasi vya rangi wazi.','Specify the quality when generating LQIP.'=>'Bainisha ubora wakati wa kutengeneza LQIP.','Larger number will generate higher resolution quality placeholder, but will result in larger files which will increase page size and consume more points.'=>'Nambari kubwa zaidi itazalisha ubora wa juu wa picha tumizi ya mwonekano, lakini itasababisha faili kubwa zaidi ambazo zitaongeza ukubwa wa ukurasa na kutumia pointi nyingi zaidi.','Changes to this setting do not apply to already-generated LQIPs. To regenerate existing LQIPs, please %s first from the admin bar menu.'=>'Mabadiliko ya mpangilio huu hayatumiki kwa LQIP ambazo tayari zimetengenezwa. Ili kutengeneza upya LQIP zilizopo, tafadhali %s kwanza kutoka kwenye menyu ya upau wa msimamizi.','pixels'=>'pixels','LQIP requests will not be sent for images where both width and height are smaller than these dimensions.'=>'Maombi ya LQIP hayatatumwa kwa picha ambazo upana na urefu wake vyote ni vidogo kuliko vipimo hivi.','Automatically generate LQIP in the background via a cron-based queue.'=>'Tengeneza LQIP kiotomatiki chinichini kupitia foleni inayotegemea cron.','If set to %1$s, before the placeholder is localized, the %2$s configuration will be used.'=>'Ikiwa imewekwa kuwa %1$s, kabla ya kishika nafasi kubinafsishwa, usanidi wa %2$s utatumika.','If set to %s this is done in the foreground, which may slow down page load.'=>'Ikiwa imewekwa kuwa %s hii inafanywa kwa mbele, jambo ambalo linaweza kupunguza kasi ya upakiaji wa ukurasa.','Size list in queue waiting for cron'=>'Ukubwa wa orodha katika folongo ya kusubiri cron','Load iframes only when they enter the viewport.'=>'Pakia iframe tu wakati zinaingia kwenye eneo la kuona.','Set an explicit width and height on image elements to reduce layout shifts and improve CLS (a Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'Weka upana na urefu ulio wazi kwenye vipengele vya picha ili kupunguza mabadiliko ya mpangilio na kuboresha CLS (kipimo cha Core Web Vitals).','Use %1$s to bypass remote image dimension check when %2$s is ON.'=>'Tumia %1$s kupita ukaguzi wa vipimo vya picha ya mbali wakati %2$s IMEWASHWA.','The image compression quality setting of WordPress out of 100.'=>'Mpangilio wa ubora wa kubana picha wa WordPress kati ya 100.','Automatically replace large images with scaled versions.'=>'Badilisha kiotomatiki picha kubwa ziwe matoleo yaliyopunguzwa ukubwa.','Scaled size threshold'=>'Kiwango cha ukubwa unaoongezeka','Filter %s available to change threshold.'=>'Kichujio cha %s kinapatikana ili kubadilisha kikomo.','Listed images will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Picha zilizoorodheshwa hazitapakiwa kwa uvivu.','Useful for above-the-fold images causing CLS (a Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'Inayofaa kwa picha za juu ya folda zinazosababisha CLS (kipimo cha Core Web Vitals).','Elements with attribute %s in html code will be excluded.'=>'Vipengele vilivyo na sifa ya %s katika msimbo wa html vitatengwa.','Images containing these class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Picha zilizo na majina haya ya darasa hazitapakiwa kwa uvivu.','Images having these parent class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Picha zilizo na majina haya ya darasa la mzazi hazitapakiwa kwa uvivu.','Iframes containing these class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Iframes zenye majina haya ya darasa hazitapakiwa kwa uvivu.','Iframes having these parent class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Iframes zenye jina la darasa hili la mzazi hazitapakiwa kwa uvivu.','Prevent any lazy load of listed pages.'=>'Zuia upakiaji mlegevu wowote wa kurasa zilizoorodheshwa.','These images will not generate LQIP.'=>'Picha hizi hazitatengeneza LQIP.','Tuning Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya Kurekebisha','Listed JS files or inline JS code will be delayed.'=>'Faili za JS zilizoorod thumbnailUrl au msimbo wa JS ulio ndani ya ukurasa utacheleweshwa.','Listed JS files or inline JS code will not be minified or combined.'=>'Faili za JS zilizoorod thumbnailUrl zilizoorodheshwa au msimbo wa JS wa ndani hautapunguzwa ukubwa wala kuchanganywa.','Predefined list will also be combined with the above settings.'=>'Orodha iliyotangulia kuandaliwa pia itachanganywa na mipangilio iliyo hapo juu.','Listed JS files or inline JS code will not be deferred or delayed.'=>'Failili za JS zilizoorod thumbnailUrl za JS zilizoorodheshwa au nambari ya JS ya ndani hazitaakhirishwa au kucheleweshwa.','Listed JS files or inline JS code will not be optimized by %s.'=>'Faili za JS zilizoorod thumbnailUrl zilizoorodheshwa au msimbo wa JS wa ndani hautaboreshwa na %s.','Prevent any optimization of listed pages.'=>'Zuia uboreshaji wowote wa kurasa zilizoorodheshwa.','Only optimize pages for guest (not logged in) visitors. If turned this OFF, CSS/JS/CCSS files will be doubled by each user group.'=>'Boresha kurasa kwa ajili ya wageni (ambao hawajaingia kwenye akaunti) pekee. Ukizima hili, faili za CSS/JS/CCSS zitaongezeka mara mbili kwa kila kikundi cha watumiaji.','Selected roles will be excluded from all optimizations.'=>'Majukumu yaliyochaguliwa yataondolewa kwenye uboreshaji wote.','Tuning CSS Settings'=>'Kuboresha Mipangilio ya CSS','Listed CSS files or inline CSS code will not be minified or combined.'=>'Faili za CSS zilizoorod thumbnailUrl au msimbo wa ndani wa CSS haziwezi kupunguzwa ukubwa au kuunganishwa.','Predefined list will also be combined with the above settings'=>'Orodha iliyotangulia kuwekwa itaunganishwa pia na mipangilio iliyo hapo juu','Listed CSS files will be excluded from UCSS and saved to inline.'=>'Faili za CSS zilizoorodheshwa hazitajumuishwa kwenye UCSS na zitahifadhiwa kwenye inline.','List the CSS selectors whose styles should always be included in UCSS.'=>'Orodhesha viteuzi vya CSS ambavyo mitindo yake inapaswa kujumuishwa kila wakati katika UCSS.','Learn more'=>'Jifunze zaidi','Wildcard %s supported.'=>'Alama ya kubadilisha (wildcard) %s inatumika.','The selector must exist in the CSS. Parent classes in the HTML will not work.'=>'Kiteuzi lazima kiwepo kwenye CSS. Madarasa ya mzazi kwenye HTML hayatafanya kazi.','Listed URI will not generate UCSS.'=>'URI iliyoorodheshwa haitazalisha UCSS.','Use %1$s to generate one single UCSS for the pages which page type is %2$s while other page types still per URL.'=>'Tumia %1$s kuzalisha UCSS moja pekee kwa ajili ya kurasa ambazo aina ya kurasa ni %2$s wakati aina zingine za kurasa zikiendelea kuwa kwa kila URL.','Use %1$s to bypass UCSS for the pages which page type is %2$s.'=>'Tumia %1$s kupita UCSS kwa kurasa ambazo aina ya ukurasa ni %2$s.','List post types where each item of that type should have its own CCSS generated.'=>'Orodhesha aina za machapisho ambapo kila kipengele cha aina hiyo kinapaswa kuwa na CCSS yake inayozalishwa.','For example, if every Page on the site has different formatting, enter %s in the box. Separate critical CSS files will be stored for every Page on the site.'=>'Kwa mfano, ikiwa kila Ukurasa kwenye tovuti una uundaji tofauti, ingiza %s kwenye kisanduku. Faili tofauti za CSS muhimu zitahifadhiwa kwa ajili ya kila Ukurasa kwenye tovuti.','Separate critical CSS files will be generated for paths containing these strings.'=>'Faili tofauti za CSS muhimu zitatengenezwa kwa njia zilizo na kamba hizi.','List the CSS selectors whose styles should always be included in CCSS.'=>'Orodhesha viteuzi vya CSS ambavyo mitindo yake inapaswa kujumuishwa kila wakati kwenye CCSS.','Selectors must exist in the CSS. Parent classes in the HTML will not work.'=>'Visisi lazima viwepo kwenye CSS. Madarasa ya mzazi katika HTML hayatafanya kazi.','Specify critical CSS rules for above-the-fold content when enabling %s.'=>'Ainisha sheria muhimu za CSS kwa maudhui yaliyo juu ya mstari unapowasha %s.','When you use Lazy Load, it will delay the loading of all images on a page.'=>'Unapotumia Lazy Load, itachelewesha upakiaji wa picha zote kwenye ukurasa.','The Viewport Images service detects which images appear above the fold, and excludes them from lazy load.'=>'Huduma ya Viewport Images hutambua ni picha zipi zinazoonekana juu ya mkunjo na kuzitenga na upakiaji wa wavivu.','This enables the page\'s initial screenful of imagery to be fully displayed without delay.'=>'Hii inaruhusu skrini ya kwanza ya paha ya picha kuonyeshwa kikamilifu bila kuchelewa.','Enable Viewport Images auto generation cron.'=>'Washa cron ya uzalishaji otomatiki wa Picha za Mwonekano.','Standard Presets'=>'Vipimo Vilivyowekwa Awali vya Kawaida','Import / Export'=>'Ingiza / Hamisha','Zinn® Cache Engine Configuration Presets'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine Mipangilio ya Awali','Essentials'=>'Muhimu','Default Cache'=>'Kache Chaguomsingi','Higher TTL'=>'TTL ya Juu','This no-risk preset is appropriate for all websites. Good for new users, simple websites, or cache-oriented development.'=>'Mpangilio huu usio na hatari unafaa kwa tovuti zote. Ni mzuri kwa watumiaji wapya, tovuti rahisi, au maendeleo yanayolenga akiba ya muda (cache).','Only basic caching features are enabled. Every option in this preset works without any online service.'=>'Vipengele vya msingi vya kache pekee ndivyo vimewashwa. Kila chaguo katika seti hii linafanya kazi bila huduma yoyote ya mtandaoni.','Basic'=>'Msingi','Everything in Essentials, Plus'=>'Kila kitu kilicho katika Essentials, Plus','Mobile Cache'=>'Kache ya Simu','This low-risk preset introduces basic optimizations for speed and user experience. Appropriate for enthusiastic beginners.'=>'Mpangilio huu wa hatari ya chini unaleta maboresho ya msingi ya kasi na uzoefu wa mtumiaji. Unaofaa kwa wanaoanza wenye shauku.','Includes optimizations known to improve site score in page speed measurement tools. Some of them need an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin, and those have no effect.'=>'Inajumuisha uboreshaji unaojulikana kuboresha alama ya tovuti katika zana za kupimia kasi ya ukurasa. Baadhi yao zinahitaji huduma ya uzalishaji mtandaoni, ambayo haijajumuishwa katika programu-jalizi hii, na hizo hazina athari.','Advanced (Recommended)'=>'Ya Juu (Inayopendekezwa)','Everything in Basic, Plus'=>'Kila kitu kilicho katika Basic, Plus','Guest Mode and Guest Optimization'=>'Hali ya Mgeni na Uboreshaji wa Mgeni','CSS, JS and HTML Minification'=>'Upunguzaji wa CSS, JS na HTML','JS Defer for both external and inline JS'=>'Kuahirisha JS kwa JS ya nje na ya ndani','DNS Prefetch for static files'=>'DNS Prefetch kwa faili tuli','Remove Query Strings from Static Files'=>'Ondoa Vigezo vya Utafutaji kutoka kwa Faili Tuli','This preset is good for most websites, and is unlikely to cause conflicts. Any CSS or JS conflicts may be resolved with Page Optimization > Tuning tools.'=>'Kipimo hiki kinafaa kwa tovuti nyingi, na hakielekei kusababisha migongano. Migongano yoyote ya CSS au JS inaweza kutatuliwa kwa kutumia zana za Page Optimization > Tuning.','Includes many optimizations known to improve page speed scores. Some of them need an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin, and those have no effect.'=>'Inajumuisha uboreshaji mwingi unaojulikana kuboresha alama za kasi ya ukurasa. Baadhi yao zinahitaji huduma ya uzalishaji mtandaoni, ambayo haijajumuishwa katika programu-jalizi hii, na zile hazina athari.','Aggressive'=>'Mkali','Everything in Advanced, Plus'=>'Kila kitu kilicho katika Advanced, Plus','CSS & JS Combine'=>'Muunganisho wa CSS & JS','Asynchronous CSS Loading with Critical CSS'=>'Upakiaji wa CSS Usiosawazishwa na CSS Muhimu','Removed Unused CSS for Users'=>'CSS Iliyotumika Haikutumika Imeondolewa kwa Watumiaji','Lazy Load for Iframes'=>'Upakiaji wa Uvivu kwa Iframes','This preset might work out of the box for some websites, but be sure to test! Some CSS or JS exclusions may be necessary in Page Optimization > Tuning.'=>'Prestihi hii inaweza kufanya kazi mara moja kwa baadhi ya tovuti, lakini hakikisha umejaribu! Baadhi ya vizuizi vya CSS au JS vinaweza kuhitajika katika Uboreshaji wa Kurasa > Usanidi.','Extreme'=>'Extreme','Everything in Aggressive, Plus'=>'Kila kitu kilicho kwenye Agressive, Pamoja na','Lazy Load for Images'=>'Upakiaji Mvivu wa Picha','Viewport Image Generation'=>'Utengenezaji wa Picha ya Sehemu ya Kutazama','JS Delayed'=>'JavaScript imecheleweshwa','Inline JS added to Combine'=>'JS ya Ndani imeongezwa kwenye Unganisha','Inline CSS added to Combine'=>'CSS ya ndani iliyoongezwa kwa Unganisha','This preset almost certainly will require testing and exclusions for some CSS, JS and Lazy Loaded images. Pay special attention to logos, or HTML-based slider images.'=>'Preset hii kwa hakika itahitaji majaribio na kutengwa kwa baadhi ya CSS, JS na picha za Lazy Loaded. Zingatia sana nembo, au picha za slaidi zinazotegemea HTML.','Enables the maximum level of optimizations for improved page speed scores. Some of them need an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin, and those have no effect.'=>'Inasuluhisha kiwango cha juu zaidi cha uboreshaji kwa ajili ya kuboresha alama za kasi ya kurasa. Baadhi yao zinahitaji huduma ya uzalishaji mtandaoni, ambayo haijajumuishwa kwenye programu-jalizi hii, na hizo hazina athari yoyote.','Zinn® Cache Engine Standard Presets'=>'Vipimo Sanifu vya Zinn® Cache Engine','Use an official LiteSpeed-designed Preset to configure your site in one click. Try no-risk caching essentials, extreme optimization, or something in between.'=>'Tumia Preset rasmi iliyoundwa na LiteSpeed kusanidi tovuti yako kwa mbofyo mmoja. Jaribu misingi ya kuweka akiba isiyo na hatari, uboreshaji uliokithiri, au kitu fulani kilicho kati ya hapo.','Who should use this preset?'=>'Nani anayepaswa kutumia mpangilio huu wa awali?','This will back up your current settings and replace them with the %1$s preset settings. Do you want to continue?'=>'Hii itahifadhi nakala rudufu ya mipangilio yako ya sasa na kuibadilisha na mipangilio ya awali ya %1$s. Unataka kuendelea?','Apply Preset'=>'Tumia Kigezo Awali','unknown'=>'haijulikani','History'=>'Historia','Error: Failed to apply the settings %1$s'=>'Hitilafu: Imeshindwa kutumia mipangilio %1$s','Restored backup settings %1$s'=>'Mipangilio ya nakala rudufu iliyorejeshwa %1$s','Applied the %1$s preset %2$s'=>'Imetumia mipangilio ya awali ya %1$s %2$s','Backup created %1$s before applying the %2$s preset'=>'Nakala rudufu imeundwa %1$s kabla ya kutumia usanidi wa awali wa %2$s','This will restore the backup settings created %1$s before applying the %2$s preset. Any changes made since then will be lost. Do you want to continue?'=>'Hii itarejesha mipangilio ya nakala rudufu iliyoundwa %1$s kabla ya kutumia %2$s preset. Mabadiliko yoyote yaliyofanywa tangu wakati huo yatapotea. Unataka kuendelea?','Restore Settings'=>'Rejesha Mipangilio','Zinn® Cache Engine View .htaccess'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine Tazama .htaccess','.htaccess Path'=>'Njia ya .htaccess','Frontend .htaccess Path'=>'Njia ya .htaccess ya Upande wa Mbele','Default path is'=>'Njia chaguomsingi ni','PHP Constant %s is supported.'=>'Kigezo cha PHP %s kinatumika.','You can use this code %1$s in %2$s to specify the htaccess file path.'=>'Unaweza kutumia nambari hii ya siri %1$s katika %2$s kubainisha njia ya faili ya htaccess.','Backend .htaccess Path'=>'Njia ya .htaccess ya Backend','Current %s Contents'=>'Yaliyomo ya Sasa ya %s','View .htaccess'=>'Angalia .htaccess','Heartbeat'=>'Mdundo wa Moyo','Debug Settings'=>'Mipangilio ya Utatuzi','Log View'=>'Mwonekano wa Kumbukumbu','Zinn® Cache Engine Toolbox'=>'Kasha ya Zinn® Cache Engine Toolbox','Heartbeat Control'=>'Udhibiti wa Mapigo ya Moyo','Disable WordPress interval heartbeat to reduce server load.'=>'Zima kipimo cha mapigo ya moyo cha muda (heartbeat interval) cha WordPress ili kupunguza mzigo wa seva.','Disabling this may cause WordPress tasks triggered by AJAX to stop working.'=>'Kulemaza hapa kunaweza kusababisha kazi za WordPress zinazochochewa na AJAX kuacha kufanya kazi.','Turn ON to control heartbeat on frontend.'=>'Washa ili udhibiti mapigo ya moyo kwenye kiolesura cha mbele.','Specify the %s heartbeat interval in seconds.'=>'Taja muda wa mapigo ya moyo ya %s kwa sekunde.','WordPress valid interval is %s seconds.'=>'Muda halali wa WordPress ni sekunde %s.','Set to %1$s to forbid heartbeat on %2$s.'=>'Weka iwe %1$s ili kukataza mapigo ya moyo kwenye %2$s.','Turn ON to control heartbeat on backend.'=>'Washa ili kudhibiti mapigo ya moyo kwenye mfumo wa nyuma.','Turn ON to control heartbeat in backend editor.'=>'Washa ili kudhibiti mapigo ya moyo katika kihariri cha nyuma.','Export Settings'=>'Hamisha Mipangilio','Export'=>'Hamisha nje','Last exported'=>'Ilisafirishwa mara ya mwisho','This will export all current Zinn® Cache Engine settings and save them as a file.'=>'Hii itasafirisha mipangilio yote ya sasa ya Zinn® Cache Engine na kuihifadhi kama faili.','Import Settings'=>'Ingiza Mipangilio','Import'=>'Agiza','Last imported'=>'Iliyopakiwa mwisho','This will import settings from a file and override all current Zinn® Cache Engine settings.'=>'Hii italeta mipangilio kutoka kwenye faili na kubatilisha mipangilio yote ya sasa ya Zinn® Cache Engine.','Reset All Settings'=>'Weka Upya Mipangilio Yote','This will reset all settings to default settings.'=>'Hii itaweka upya mipangilio yote kuwa ya kwanza.','Are you sure you want to reset all settings back to the default settings?'=>'Una uhakika unataka kuweka upya mipangilio yote kwenye mipangilio chaguomsingi?','Reset Settings'=>'Weka Upya Mipangilio','Purge Log'=>'Futa Kumbukumbu','Crawler Log'=>'Kumbukumbu ya Crawler','LiteSpeed Logs'=>'Rekodi za LiteSpeed','Clear Logs'=>'Futa Kumbukumbu','Click to copy'=>'Bonyeza ili kunakili','Copy Log'=>'Nakili Kumbukumbu','Click to download'=>'Bofya ili kupakua','Download'=>'Pakua','Purge Front Page'=>'Futa Ukurasa wa Mbele','This will Purge Front Page only'=>'Hii itasafisha Ukurasa wa Mbele pekee','Purge Pages'=>'Futa Kurasa','This will Purge Pages only'=>'Hii itasafisha Kurasa pekee','Purge %s Error'=>'Futa Hitilafu ya %s','Purge %s error pages'=>'Futa kurasa za makosa za %s','Purge the LiteSpeed cache entries created by this plugin'=>'Safisha maingizo ya kashi ya LiteSpeed yaliyoundwa na programu-jalizi hii','This will purge all minified/combined CSS/JS entries only'=>'Hii itafuta tu maingizo yote ya CSS/JS yaliyopunguzwa ukubwa/yaliyochanganywa','Purge all the object caches'=>'Futa kache zote za vitu','Reset the entire opcode cache'=>'Weka upya kashi nzima ya opkodi','Critical CSS'=>'CSS Muhimu','This will delete all generated critical CSS files'=>'Hii itafuta faili zote za CSS muhimu zilizozalishwa','Unique CSS'=>'CSS ya Kipekee','This will delete all generated unique CSS files'=>'Hii itafuta faili zote za kipekee za CSS zilizozalishwa','This will delete all localized resources'=>'Hii itafuta rasilimali zote zilizojanibishwa','This will delete all generated image LQIP placeholder files'=>'Hii itafuta faili zote za kishikilia nafasi za picha za LQIP zilizotengenezwa','This will delete all generated Viewport Images'=>'Hii itafuta Picha zote za Viewport zilizozalishwa','This will delete all cached Gravatar files'=>'Hii itafuta faili zote za Gravatar zilizohifadhiwa kwenye kache','Purge the cache entries created by this plugin except for Critical CSS & Unique CSS & LQIP caches'=>'Futa maingizo ya akiba yaliyoundwa na programu-jalizi hii isipokuwa akiba za CSS Muhimu & CSS ya Kipekee & LQIP','Empty Entire Cache'=>'Futa Akiba Nzima','Clears all cache entries related to this site, including other web applications.'=>'Inafuta maingizo yote ya kache yanayohusiana na tovuti hii, pamoja na programu zingine za wavuti.','This action should only be used if things are cached incorrectly.'=>'Kitendo hiki kinapasਵਾ kutumika tu ikiwa mambo yamehifadhiwa kwenye kache kimakosa.','This will clear EVERYTHING inside the cache.'=>'Hii itafuta KILA KITU kilicho ndani ya kache.','This may cause heavy load on the server.'=>'Hii inaweza kusababisha mzigo mkubwa kwenye seva.','If only the WordPress site should be purged, use Purge All.'=>'Ikiwa ni tovuti ya WordPress pekee ndiyo inapaswa kufutwa, tumia Futa Zote.','Purge By...'=>'Safisha Kwa...','Select below for "Purge by" options.'=>'Chagua hapa chini kwa chaguo za "Safisha kwa".','Category'=>'Kategoria','Post ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha Chapisho','Tag'=>'Lebo','Purge pages by category name - e.g. %2$s should be used for the URL %1$s.'=>'Futa kurasa kwa jina la kategoria - km. %2$s inapaswa kutumika kwa ajili ya URL %1$s.','Purge pages by post ID.'=>'Safisha kurasa kwa kitambulisho cha chapisho.','Purge pages by tag name - e.g. %2$s should be used for the URL %1$s.'=>'Futa kurasa kwa jina la lebo - kwa mfano %2$s inapaswa kutumiwa kwa URL %1$s.','Purge pages by relative or full URL.'=>'Futa kurasa kwa kutumia URL ya jamaa au kamili.','e.g. Use %1$s or %2$s.'=>'k.mf. Tumia %1$s au %2$s.','Purge List'=>'Orodha ya Kufuta Kabisa','Debug Helpers'=>'Vifaa vya Utatuzi','View Site Before Optimization'=>'Tazama Tovuti Kabla ya Uboreshaji','View Site Before Cache'=>'Angalia Tovuti Kabla ya Akiba','Disable All Features for 24 Hours'=>'Zima Vipengele Vyote kwa Saa 24','Remove `Disable All Feature` Flag Now'=>'Ondoa Bendera ya `Disable All Feature` Sasa','Zinn® Cache Engine is temporarily disabled until: %s.'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine imezimwa kwa muda hadi: %s.','This will disable LSCache and all optimization features for debug purpose.'=>'Hii itazima LSCache na vipengele vyote vya uboreshaji kwa madhumuni ya utatuzi.','Admin IP Only'=>'IP ya Msimamizi Pekee','Outputs to a series of files in the %s directory.'=>'Hutoa matokeo katika mfululizo wa faili kwenye saraka ya %s.','To prevent filling up the disk, this setting should be OFF when everything is working.'=>'Ili kuzuia diski kujaa, mpangilio huu unapaswa kuwa umezimwa wakati kila kitu kinafanya kazi vizuri.','The Admin IP option will only output log messages on requests from admin IPs listed below.'=>'Chaguo la IP ya Msimamizi litatoa tu ujumbe wa kumbukumbu kwenye maombi kutoka kwa IP za wasimamizi zilizoorodheshwa hapa chini.','Allows listed IPs (one per line) to perform certain actions from their browsers.'=>'Inaruhusu anwani za IP zilizoorodheshwa (moja kwa kila mstari) kufanya vitendo fulani kutoka kwa vivinjari vyao.','Your IP'=>'IP Yako','More information about the available commands can be found here.'=>'Taarifa zaidi kuhusu amri zinazopatikana zinaweza kupatikana hapa.','Advanced level will log more details.'=>'Kiwango cha juu kitaandikisha maelezo zaidi.','MB'=>'MB','Specify the maximum size of the log file.'=>'Bainisha ukubwa wa juu zaidi wa faili ya kumbukumbu.','Shorten query strings in the debug log to improve readability.'=>'Fupisha vigezo vya hoja kwenye logi ya utatuzi ili kuboresha usomaji.','Only log listed pages.'=>'Weka kumbukumbu ya kurasa zilizoorodheshwa pekee.','Prevent any debug log of listed pages.'=>'Zuia kumbukumbu yoyote ya utatuzi ya kurasa zilizoorodheshwa.','Prevent writing log entries that include listed strings.'=>'Zuia uandikaji wa viingilio vya kumbukumbu ambavyo vinajumuisha vifulizio vilivyoorodheshwa.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Tazama maelezo ya toleo la Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sasisho lililopakuliwa limeshindwa ukaguzi wa uadilifu na halijasakinishwa.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — miongozo na huduma','User guides'=>'Miongozo ya watumiaji','Read the %s user guide'=>'Soma mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa %s','Hide this'=>'Ficha hii','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® hosting ya WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, nakala rudufu za kila siku, uhamiaji wa bure na kidhibiti kilichoundwa kwa ajili ya watu wanaoendesha zaidi ya tovuti moja.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Soko la Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Nunua na uuze tovuti zilizopo, vikoa na uwekaji wa viungo, huku pesa zikiwa zimewekwa kwa usalama hadi pande zote mbili ziwe na furaha.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ajiri watu wanaofanya kazi hii kwa ajili ya riziki','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Soko letu la kimataifa la wafanyakazi huru: vinjari huduma zaidi ya 10,000 zilizotengenezwa tayari kutoka kwa waandishi, wabunifu, watengenezaji programu na wataalamu wa SEO, au chapisha mradi na uwaruhusu watoe zabuni.']];